thub.com/users/janmoudy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janMoudry/Fluxa/commits/7a150bb9c7900c0b13c5eee58a044da4c458fecd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-22T21:18:27Z","email":"jan.moudry@metait.cz","name":"jan.moudry"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-22T21:18:27Z","email":"jan.moudry@metait.cz","name":"jan.moudry"},"message":"feat: implement Fluxa event bus with support for scoped events and multiple transports\n\n- Add `Scope` class for managing prefixed event names and handlers.\n- Introduce `FluxaEventMap`, `FluxaEnvelope`, and related types for event handling.\n- Implement `BroadcastChannelTransport`, `MemoryTransport`, and `PostMessageTransport` for cross-tab and cross-frame communication.\n- Create utility functions for safe serialization and metadata creation.\n- Add tests for event bus functionality, transport reliability, and performance benchmarks.\n- Establish a debugging utility to log event directions and metadata.\n- Configure TypeScript with strict settings and output directory.","tree":{"sha":"15cb31f19ef262ea74bb6a9c0ebf3c1196d91882","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janMoudry/Fluxa/git/trees/15cb31f19ef262ea74bb6a9c0ebf3c1196d91882"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/janMoudry/Fluxa/git/commits/7a150bb9c7900c0b13c5eee58a044da4c458fecd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/148947430?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janmoudy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janmoudy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janmoudy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janmoudy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/janmoudy","id":148947430,"login":"janmoudy","node_id":"U_kgDOCODB5g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/janmoudy/orgs"