rnst@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Phillip-Ernst"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-04T19:04:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add OAuth2 login support (Google and GitHub) (#23)\n\n- Add spring-boot-starter-oauth2-client dependency\n- Add NutriFitOAuth2UserService (GitHub), NutriFitOidcUserService (Google),\n  and OAuth2AuthenticationSuccessHandler that issues a JWT on success\n- Extract PasswordEncoderConfig to break circular dependency\n- Update SecurityConfig: OAuth2 login, session IF_REQUIRED, SameSite=Lax\n- Make User.password nullable; add provider/providerId fields\n- Add V6 migration: drop NOT NULL on password, add provider/provider_id columns\n- Rename V5__drop_meal_tables -> V5_1 to fix duplicate version conflict\n- Add findByProviderAndProviderId to UserRepository\n- Add findOrCreateOAuthUser to UserService\n- Add OAuth2 login buttons (Google, GitHub) to LoginPage\n- Add OAuth2CallbackPage to handle post-login token redirect\n- Fix Vite proxy to use changeOrigin: true for correct cookie forwarding\n- Set local redirect URIs through Vite proxy (localhost:5173) to fix session cookie mismatch\n- Update docker-compose.yml: add nutrition-service, fix DB init script mount\n- Update ECS task definition with OAuth2 secrets\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a237e1381b1caedfb53b9e6bc516957b04462b3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Phillip-Ernst/NutriFit/git/trees/a237e1381b1caedfb53b9e6bc516957b04462b3e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Phillip-Ernst/NutriFit/git/commits/204e8beef8ea1d3ca07bef0a6bac054ba5054c32","verification":{"payload":"tree a237e1381b1caedfb53b9e6bc516957b04462b3e\nparent 5514afbd85fb3994d38e9563e11c29676219d504\nauthor Phillip-Ernst <114964205+Phillip-Ernst@users.noreply.github.com> 1772651060 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772651060 -0600\n\nAdd OAuth2 login support (Google and GitHub) (#23)\n\n- Add spring-boot-starter-oauth2-client dependency\n- Add NutriFitOAuth2UserService (GitHub), NutriFitOidcUserService (Google),\n  and OAuth2AuthenticationSuccessHandler that issues a JWT on success\n- Extract PasswordEncoderConfig to break circular dependency\n- Update SecurityConfig: OAuth2 login, session IF_REQUIRED, SameSite=Lax\n- Make User.password nullable; add provider/providerId fields\n- Add V6 migration: drop NOT NULL on password, add provider/provider_id columns\n- Rename V5__drop_meal_tables -> V5_1 to fix duplicate version conflict\n- Add findByProviderAndProviderId to UserRepository\n- Add findOrCreateOAuthUser to UserService\n- Add OAuth2 login buttons (Google, GitHub) to LoginPage\n- Add OAuth2CallbackPage to handle post-login token redirect\n- Fix Vite proxy to use changeOrigin: true for correct cookie forwarding\n- Set local redirect URIs through Vite proxy (localhost:5173) to fix session cookie mismatch\n- Update docker-compose.yml: add nutrition-service, fix DB init script mount\n- Update ECS task definition with OAuth2 secrets\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpqII0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAcL0QAExgTmowRxbdb/k8k9g/2l10\n50mI12AhfRCo9ZqgI7Mzq9D1KQGATBmuzhSnvZxAP2VOO9BStnJ9szugTuk2UyIw\nLIgM9jbnXGy4bxoifkmwFl5ThNp7H5CS0IYKSToW025ZsbdkfOpkklmh+5IlBJjB\n1+Wp0xSZI2+p1NVlctbbSA397PL/SPNKC/WRJ92Zdkdx6Qxpur2nUsu0USl2uRRA\nsRjugelVC7k4es/3Q4pwzeGLj2Nau/sgVOdUw4KSjTiKd0O7JLQs7Xs66BfVCWeR\ngqO3F0wO1Lcb59ej9UyJK7P2XwedPHBEwrHe24oprtwtr3NIdpo4sy2VOLcB5JW3\nc5D8FLDCNJJeP37uKlPJVrRbCsBqa+i7w1h9zRPWEvV+lVtcEMxE3G8Yi6HPgAmH\nN1VsoQbUxxjXo5KQupfPis8rNxk+ImNK8oKepnCbi3BhgJrl8mR2jQ6QbzRpbfAN\njDZuqmdAcqn3xV+iBND6ZmFx+JigLZ7tArOhbjXokBB04dPXoiUua6G+RCQaWt0l\njz3FW+50CZAKzXNVIpuowTmuOIj/JpB39jmDNq++gsUZ8uXYMJV2vCxlv/bLXFLz\nCXDAwev5vb6sFeXD1HzfPF+RbIHb+QK1CjiJFOU6Zup512bhdUe1xnZjmf9LEqN8\nWYVxfSqWx4Y3O+pibN+s\n=YD3q\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-04T19:04:21Z"}},"committ