ers (response_body_to_string, make_test_request, etc.)\n- 23 per-domain suite files (*_suite.ml) covering response, router, cookie,\n  etag, multipart, compress, ratelimit, websocket, sse, template, tls, grpc,\n  graphql, pool, backpressure, cache, jobs, parallel, health, metrics,\n  shutdown, webrtc, and query/migrate/db\n\ntest_kirin.ml is now a 36-line thin runner that aggregates all suites.\nAll 210 tests pass identically.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: bump version to 2.1.4\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"398bb7d2590df005be1a7d3ac85809c99956d161","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/trees/398bb7d2590df005be1a7d3ac85809c99956d161"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/commits/4a1f1b4a71784078b41e96e95d8574b1ead1ca93","verification":{"payload":"tree 398bb7d2590df005be1a7d3ac85809c99956d161\nparent 14a783a49e2b289da20c029c4e9ff7e99d454ca1\nauthor Jeong-Sik Yun <45959991+jeong-sik@users.noreply.github.com> 1774449313 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774449313 +0900\n\nrefactor(test): split 2484-line test monolith into 25 per-module test files (#72)\n\n* refactor(test): split 2484-line test monolith into per-module test files\n\nSplit test/test_kirin.ml (2484 lines, 210 tests) into 24 focused modules:\n- test_helpers.ml: shared helpers (response_body_to_string, make_test_request, etc.)\n- 23 per-domain suite files (*_suite.ml) covering response, router, cookie,\n  etag, multipart, compress, ratelimit, websocket, sse, template, tls, grpc,\n  graphql, pool, backpressure, cache, jobs, parallel, health, metrics,\n  shutdown, webrtc, and query/migrate/db\n\ntest_kirin.ml is now a 36-line thin runner that aggregates all suites.\nAll 210 tests pass identically.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: bump version to 2.1.4\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude