os/jeong-sik/kirin/commits/e5c8fee99bb128045ba7119937d16da06a8f3872/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T06:17:54Z","email":"45959991+jeong-sik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeong-Sik Yun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T06:17:54Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(i18n): split West Slavic plural rules from East Slavic per CLDR (#69)\n\nPolish/Czech/Slovak use n==1 for One (only exact 1), while\nRussian/Ukrainian use n%10==1 && n%100!=11 (1, 21, 31...).\nThe previous code applied Russian rules to all Slavic languages,\ncausing Polish count=21 to incorrectly select the One form.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"df9a21d0de242478ce7a9e17e78b82b5461a0930","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/trees/df9a21d0de242478ce7a9e17e78b82b5461a0930"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/commits/e5c8fee99bb128045ba7119937d16da06a8f3872","verification":{"payload":"tree df9a21d0de242478ce7a9e17e78b82b5461a0930\nparent 59f183f0328598c5716196bedab5060e63698353\nauthor Jeong-Sik Yun <45959991+jeong-sik@users.noreply.github.com> 1774246674 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774246674 +0900\n\nfix(i18n): split West Slavic plural rules from East Slavic per CLDR (#69)\n\nPolish/Czech/Slovak use n==1 for One (only exact 1), while\nRussian/Ukrainian use n%10==1 && n%100!=11 (1, 21, 31...).\nThe previous code applied Russian rules to all Slavic languages,\ncausing Polish count=21 to incorrectly select the One form.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpwNsSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACkkQAIlx/nQv3MSjkYCQxBbg0AvM\nJsDjJ0xvNOYM1J/PKXOhaDyXmuCGfZhnglBaWZDJSlNUzcwq+iXb7f4COO5PZtXR\n5c8vLSiIuEr7POsXn+HALpA5zLxxZIA2hz8wn0yFMavfFnKcH5egdVaPONSM7+QY\n446YQCB+SpC4ul1+4gVQ+wP1gUQjBLZHubYI/Od0fxhpfuMtuGH48x7VboMUE2Z8\nBvA9La2hdGVAs1Nd3/2LOID