s","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/commits/5404f7e344468e10fc35a5e76d0943c551b4ff76/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T01:04:34Z","email":"45959991+jeong-sik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeong-Sik Yun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T01:04:34Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(cookie): use constant-time comparison for HMAC signature verification (#65)\n\nCookie.verify used structural equality (=) to compare HMAC signatures,\nwhich short-circuits on the first differing byte and leaks timing\ninformation about the expected signature. Replace with Eqaf.equal for\nconstant-time comparison, consistent with auth/jwt.ml which already\nuses this pattern.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"129889ed9cdf3ae0982be4213cd0c5a6a312010a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/trees/129889ed9cdf3ae0982be4213cd0c5a6a312010a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/commits/5404f7e344468e10fc35a5e76d0943c551b4ff76","verification":{"payload":"tree 129889ed9cdf3ae0982be4213cd0c5a6a312010a\nparent 74b4e0c73a23b50c75b678cc08556a282d392eff\nauthor Jeong-Sik Yun <45959991+jeong-sik@users.noreply.github.com> 1774227874 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774227874 +0900\n\nfix(cookie): use constant-time comparison for HMAC signature verification (#65)\n\nCookie.verify used structural equality (=) to compare HMAC signatures,\nwhich short-circuits on the first differing byte and leaks timing\ninformation about the expected signature. Replace with Eqaf.equal for\nconstant-time comparison, consistent with auth/jwt.ml which already\nuses this pattern.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpwJGiCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABF