jeong-sik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeong-sik","id":45959991,"login":"jeong-sik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTU5OTkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/commits/50159215dff24429b9bee2cdbf57dc18d14a754d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T00:41:23Z","email":"45959991+jeong-sik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeong-Sik Yun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T00:41:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: replace Printf.eprintf with Logger in cluster.ml (#63)\n\ncluster.ml was missed in dd43367 (Printf.eprintf → Logger migration).\nReplace 3 eprintf + 2 printf calls with Logger.info/warn/error.\n\nAfter fork(), Logger.emit falls back to synchronous write when\nthe background domain is not running, so this is safe in child\nprocesses.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fce307deed6a69c1ab4e7746a7fc62157fa93c0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/trees/fce307deed6a69c1ab4e7746a7fc62157fa93c0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/commits/50159215dff24429b9bee2cdbf57dc18d14a754d","verification":{"payload":"tree fce307deed6a69c1ab4e7746a7fc62157fa93c0c\nparent ba04a141a6f0a84c975c0e50fbd75330f91bdeaf\nauthor Jeong-Sik Yun <45959991+jeong-sik@users.noreply.github.com> 1774226483 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774226483 +0900\n\nfix: replace Printf.eprintf with Logger in cluster.ml (#63)\n\ncluster.ml was missed in dd43367 (Printf.eprintf → Logger migration).\nReplace 3 eprintf + 2 printf calls with Logger.info/warn/error.\n\nAfter fork(), Logger.emit falls back to synchronous write when\nthe background domain is not running, so this is safe in child\nprocesses.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpwIwzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACyEQAAyRZXXUHe0wiqtH61oaLdgs\nLTW0HnJMZDXruihywH6Qi8uOlDPRKM+P211+g29qE41MWAASPDsEZJu4PT4K1kTd\neloLo153Zh108q0x/HcO/L8eoQNyuyZqe4x9ycX/JRnptw8zvS73K1wY57T+ogui\nxUQNh2R/SXLulqeHhxt6lRDzlEcbdAaTKp7Jf7G6ZiJXYmtQIs+WFOMOQaa7iRrP\n2nSSIktLwLo/nTW77/pf9NnzKjxq3pTJNZQITly8oiKC81EiQMsh5bJPS6PLwJC9\nzZCJ0hchVZnILtc9YJPYpNASrZGHbmirylEtV/eBfJdY3het7uiHoqrxoGXw2BaL\no0eTRYedk7mxCVbwa4tTpOunpvNwUlk03CLol32iHhswFjt20oa/Mgx0bl0Hn9Pk\ntbAIzg1kZuQlQxpTMXDBuX2xe87WqWsXWb7r7YVLXwsVqMz4lUkFIr75bUztQnxW\n76YurF5i7aTMk0fVbZUwRCDG4puWEHSvnxpOQmZwGqmxpuX/Lo/9ZuNrxkbHiOe/\naStT1J9MgXbOiHfL3PfkjIW5E/EjD5eiSfClCzBT8xw/EpTqZJCq/DP1pObqr6F/\nQfmQ7U2isXgD5X1OGj+P5meml3UuCNgTKCcgq7QX4pxB7cntxTW+9V9gRYAhErgg\nFCg69v6HkVUs12Hurfva\n=MFqH\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-23T00:41:25Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/w