ttps://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeong-sik","id":45959991,"login":"jeong-sik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTU5OTkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/commits/957cde4c97ca0f7b4d1824dbc83d795e7640f2ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-22T17:00:46Z","email":"45959991+jeong-sik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeong-Sik Yun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-22T17:00:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(solid): narrow catch-all exception handlers in worker.ml (#61)\n\nReplace `with e ->` catch-alls with specific exception types:\n- start: Unix.Unix_error (the only exception Unix.pipe/create_process raise)\n- send_request: Sys_error (broken pipe) + End_of_file (subprocess closed)\n\nThis prevents silently swallowing fatal exceptions like Out_of_memory.\nAlso sync kirin.opam version with dune-project (2.1.1).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f2bb62432a0650913a0c1a40e8e5739268675c00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/trees/f2bb62432a0650913a0c1a40e8e5739268675c00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/commits/957cde4c97ca0f7b4d1824dbc83d795e7640f2ae","verification":{"payload":"tree f2bb62432a0650913a0c1a40e8e5739268675c00\nparent dd4336704b2862a757c8c8629fa413f27132de3f\nauthor Jeong-Sik Yun <45959991+jeong-sik@users.noreply.github.com> 1774198846 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774198846 +0900\n\nfix(solid): narrow catch-all exception handlers in worker.ml (#61)\n\nReplace `with e ->` catch-alls with specific exception types:\n- start: Unix.Unix_error (the only exception Unix.pipe/create_process raise)\n- send_request: Sys_error (broken pipe) + End_of_file (subprocess closed)\n\nThis prevents silently swallowing fatal exceptions like Out_of_memory.\nAlso sync kirin.opam version with dune-project (2.1.1).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpwCA+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAAfsQAGE/aNHtRou9td5CdWB9Um/h\nWsZPI6orbW4PoShI1hlzS9Jk20mOVxR15+rI928kO84CB7OZIaUeu70tlOKwnKZd\nl+gydFHCf8VNU7BPMZCqfOoCVq/1lwj/e9AwPyDR2CBrLs1hKhLdLmiymPe/YR6e\nzMrhmhUld+mI6qobDq9+nKj1RyCAP4+8zFI6jC0oA60OFSRopWGohLTRBHmmlOVm\nnZEz73Z2B/CwPpczNdU04wKrvn4HCmB/PhoNlGPUhy1crCtUMlGzjvqqm8XA0rzh\nNJSRUb1gCV6ZFh9Bdyl5bLfCc79Ekz10vSHlIY7/AH0LL9SfP+JXF3qupAgnEXGJ\n3pyMD33w/2sguI55TgSqIHiiLsWKBcv6Vs5FaZ+bsZ8fnzDxta60kCZOSaiWyDDg\nuR5t/7+AdJOGuQeSGpg6dpqERQCHtCitBTi05N04+OauyToB0FVqpQV5AlEsC6eT\nxoG7VIq/nSY5+mfZ74TqvDALi4ZKg4TPB3fawm2kkjDaO2zyDhbbLWaqpgCbWrA0\nUJYO0Y/1I03lo44hPoOomeHeFApJMwCl0Ysk2Ym2y7oWB8gClsANAX46MKq4V8Bo\nuMwRB/8MjysnVFVz5m+lA78G59v/vgDKBsBYLQvmX/gGpitzTQAlkb4Ksg1aYyUc\nGKAL4UlLMFu06GT0Sp1o\n=R3xB\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-22T17:00:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organiza