thubusercontent.com/u/45959991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeong-sik","id":45959991,"login":"jeong-sik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTU5OTkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/commits/bd9d184437d7dbbe1915d616ecf1cc9a11e56b3a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-22T14:12:27Z","email":"45959991+jeong-sik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeong-Sik Yun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-22T14:12:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(auth,graphql,server): resolve 3 issues — auth double-exec, introspection control, producer lifecycle (#57)\n\nIssue #48 (any_of auth double execution):\nRewrite any_of to probe auth strategies with a lightweight sentinel\nhandler instead of the real handler. Only after auth succeeds is the\nreal handler called exactly once. Previously, a business-logic 4xx\nwas misinterpreted as auth failure, causing the handler to execute\nmultiple times with side effects.\n\nIssue #47 (introspection always enabled):\nAdd enable_introspection parameter to Graphql.middleware (default: true).\nWhen false, GET requests return 403 and POST requests containing\n__schema/__type introspection fields are rejected. Normal queries\ncontinue to work. Updates both .ml and .mli.\n\nIssue #42 (producer fiber outlives request):\nThe per-request sub-switch fix was already applied in commit dc8189d.\nThis commit adds regression tests verifying that producer fibers are\ncancelled when the request switch exits (simulating client disconnect)\nand that normal completion still works correctly.\n\n12 new tests: 4 any_of, 6 introspection, 2 cancellation.\n\nCloses #42, closes #47, closes #48\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"caae17e42ac1dd4f5e567165573152b46a7d64a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/trees/caae17e42ac1dd4f5e567165573152b46a7d64a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/commits/bd9d184437d7dbbe1915d616ecf1cc9a11e56b3a","verification":{"payload":"tree caae17e42ac1dd4f5e567165573152b46a7d64a7\nparent 11efb121010da4047d1a92fc5cfb6e2698da4242\nauthor Jeong-Sik Yun <45959991+jeong-sik@users.noreply.github.com> 1774188747 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774188747 +0900\n\nfix(auth,graphql,server): resolve 3 issues — auth double-exec, introspection control, producer lifecycle (#57)\n\nIssue #48 (any_of auth double execution):\nRewrite any_of to probe auth strategies with a lightweight sentinel\nhandler instead of the real handler. Only after auth succeeds is the\nreal handler called exactly once. Previously, a business-logic 4xx\nwas misinterpreted as auth failure, causing the handler to execute\nmultiple times with side effects.\n\nIssue #47 (introspection always enabled):\nAdd enable_introspection parameter to Graphql.middleware (default: true).\nWhen false, GET requests return 403 and POST requests containing\n__schema/__type introspection fields are rejected. Normal queries\ncontinue to work. Updates both .ml and .mli.\n\nIssue #42 (producer fiber outlives request):\nThe per-request sub-switch fix was already applied in commit dc8189d.\nThis commit adds regression tests verifying that producer fibers are\ncancelled when the request switch exits (simulating client disconnect)\nand that normal completion still works correctly.\n\n12 new tests: 4 any_of, 6 introspection, 2 cancellation.\n\nCloses #42, closes #47, closes #48\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpv/jLCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAg3cQAHLX/HroHqjXILxPNl/KS3FQ\n3LhbuGyUlA6Gwgc+n+j2LRUU8cCsYHdVCCa2ENFpA1rVAX0D/Wh3TXRJ0Z2JgWLf\nxZhoxamGl5YmZK7udKvGRj0y+4hZFuOmhY3ERz2z00XVRRJf2AkgkqMv+lYkJ0h7\nnH1ksGLrecIPLJcqjpbDvpZ3/bGoeT0nPA6L8dZwQQ2rIp7atDIcCONaapDbKEcc\nnDkTre7Z5pWv7McllP8L3cbG/+5c8fs06GM6AB1H9VJGdVpvx1mTseS0i6irQcKI\neBgjXQ+lIkb6FcCAIM8URjMmyH5r5EWwXR0ERENpbKarszS1x+EyftMliQLhlCry\nc0IV5HEtP5wC2uzos2E29Q5pNe5Ni9oc8JjxRUcXS4pdKSH3aF5OesdBxZj8bg7r\nboL21LJkgHstYK1ZAZNMhAvFZHnh8JAjOzSh/K1IfKv3eGV4EC3xXLt1Kja9jJss\nqJxv1Oh0Pedfy2jTUa8Cq5v1VHBJS5EIDKT1cXBA9Pq7nGZQNX+2b+LhmsjBMJ60\nREc02q/eZtopUWi6NfB+R05yzluqQ/C5GqxPGCuQFfRyEe1w0yziw7DnGEXUxfUW\n6zG79U2n+Zru23V/OVUUc7bhd6s+EqVnM2iB9diUF0G/TbyrlL3/DktX7WAQrWJS\nXeD9wONvJ+P3+rnbX1m5\n=pHjk\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-22T14:12:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jeong-sik/kirin/commit/bd9d184437d7dbbe1915d616ecf1cc9a11e56b3a","node_id":"C_kwDOQ_igeNoAKGJkOWQxODQ0MzdkN2RiYmUxOTE1ZDYxNmVjZjFjYzlhMTFlNTZiM2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jeong-sik/kirin/commit/11efb121010da4047d1a92fc5cfb6e2698da4242","sha":"11efb121010da4047d1a92fc5cfb6e2698da4242","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/commits/11efb121010da4047d1a92fc5cfb6e2698da4242"}],"sha":"bd9d184437d7dbbe1915d616ecf1cc9a11e56b3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/commits/bd9d184437d7dbbe1915d616ecf1cc9a11e56b3a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45959991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeong-sik","id":45959991,"login":"jeong-sik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTU5OTkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/commits/11efb121010da4047d1a92fc5cfb6e2698da4242/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-22T14:08:04Z","email":"45959991+jeong-sik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeong-Sik Yun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-22T14:08:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(auth): replace global ref with per-request Hmap context (#56)\n\nThe auth_middleware module used a module-level `current_auth` ref to pass\nauth info through the handler chain. Under concurrent Eio fibers, this\ncaused a data race where one request could overwrite another''s auth state.\n\nReplace the global ref with an Hmap key stored in Request.ctx. Each\nrequest now carries its own auth_info in an immutable Hmap, eliminating\nthe race entirely without needing a mutex.\n\nChanges:\n- auth_middleware.ml: replace `current_auth` ref with `auth_key` Hmap.key,\n  `set_auth_info` writes to Request.ctx, `get_auth_info` reads from it\n- auth_middleware.mli: remove `current_auth` from public API, tighten\n  signatures to use `Kirin.Request.t` instead of polymorphic types\n- test_auth.ml: add 6 middleware tests including concurrent fiber\n  isolation test proving two fibers see independent auth state\n\nCloses #39\nRef #49 (ratelimit Eio.Mutex was already fixed in dc8189d)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4679d037171154cc25a6f90ef0bb78d793cd5a21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/trees/4679d037171154cc25a6f90ef0bb78d793cd5a21"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/commits/11efb121010da4047d1a92fc5cfb6e2698da4242","verification":{"payload":"tree 4679d037171154cc25a6f90ef0bb78d793cd5a21\nparent cc4d72e024ca73f8ec2737f47ac50541bbb5c563\nauthor Jeong-Sik Yun <45959991+jeong-sik@users.noreply.github.com> 1774188484 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774188484 +0900\n\nfix(auth): replace global ref with per-request Hmap context (#56)\n\nThe auth_middleware module used a module-level `current_auth` ref to pass\nauth info through the handler chain. Under concurrent Eio fibers, this\ncaused a data race where one request could overwrite another''s auth state.\n\nReplace the global ref with an Hmap key stored in Request.ctx. Each\nrequest now carries its own auth_info in an immutable Hmap, eliminating\nthe race entirely without needing a mutex.\n\nChanges:\n- auth_middleware.ml: replace `current_auth` ref with `auth_key` Hmap.key,\n  `set_auth_info` writes to Request.ctx, `get_auth_info` reads from it\n- auth_middleware.mli: remove `current_auth` from public API, tighten\n  signatures to use `Kirin.Request.t` instead of polymorphic types\n- test_auth.ml: add 6 middleware tests including concurrent fiber\n  isolation test proving two fibers see independent auth state\n\nCloses #39\nRef #49 (ratelimit Eio.Mutex was already fixed in dc8189d)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpv/fECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA4gcQAJl+LD7N/o5kH+ubperjp7eS\n3NyPIN9gFMyb57PQ650nXiULRGdIFVFsoLtJJvilDjyDKG/sKnRnMykH54yqMNCA\nZBPLQuPjmudG/C3v6BPbdSysW8apJp03GKkttZ2ailoE0bsM1bb+U1L0Shqj9tAs\nh2zAiP+lGv/1+LYyE2s7YbVG/8sH0cRQRgeXkWHVsEWan8WqnE3qDuy+P4gECQp9\n+lAPfLMxTphf5H6zU+LsMvNzhwSep/lNQzaREcSE9oiO/wdKNn8jhbS+67GIwMZ5\nxr3rNudpTKMFNDMG8DAL9Lm/nyNqQtAWEfnhm4HuLa6FpdqArDujgij+EP0Fn2BL\n6/igmuSvXeCXkxcPsPFdIWGTyyduXsbRXrXQzIDDGygJJh91/5KO6ZCHttrlGqDp\nJNkysY5yOtomiadyEw1se4Fc2+C5as8OEGmjKCPRj2qIYL5xAjjXhJfuMPTkVFQq\n9OTb5sDq0EVATkvrd4CqKXjENI9D1NjVWS1d4VY2nAVo0guml+Z/ylbT4kECS3ih\nD46F6lgg2gkT0u06Z1rOB+YOBJEzlVxcWgwsG4EiVBDsrqYI7B+ZNT9exi31cwmn\nqb+usJTPBdSuUltpL4fuVP9Z7mc/uFedWlHETMXkIJgJsUobQdKv/LRplrAWO7xd\ntCh2DTSa71kNA5rld4iZ\n=7Sr4\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-22T14:08:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jeong-sik/kirin/commit/11efb121010da4047d1a92fc5cfb6e2698da4242","node_id":"C_kwDOQ_igeNoAKDExZWZiMTIxMDEwZGE0MDQ3ZDFhOTJmYzVjZmI2ZTI2OThkYTQyNDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jeong-sik/kirin/commit/cc4d72e024ca73f8ec2737f47ac50541bbb5c563","sha":"cc4d72e024ca73f8ec2737f47ac50541bbb5c563","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/commits/cc4d72e024ca73f8ec2737f47ac50541bbb5c563"}],"sha":"11efb121010da4047d1a92fc5cfb6e2698da4242","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/commits/11efb121010da4047d1a92fc5cfb6e2698da4242"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45959991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeong-sik","id":45959991,"login":"jeong-sik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTU5OTkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/commits/cc4d72e024ca73f8ec2737f47ac50541bbb5c563/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-22T13:39:24Z","email":"45959991+jeong-sik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeong-Sik Yun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-22T13:39:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor(stream): convert blocking Unix I/O to Eio.Path operations (#55)\n\nfile_response, file_inline, save_upload, and save_upload_with_progress\nused blocking Unix.openfile/Unix.read/Unix.write_substring which blocks\nthe entire Eio thread during file I/O. This converts them to use\nEio.Path.with_open_in/with_open_out via Fs_compat.get_fs() when the\nEio filesystem is available, with a fallback to the existing Unix calls\nfor test contexts where Fs_compat is not initialized.\n\nAlso extracts duplicated file-reading logic into read_file_to_stream.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b9a176fc3ace7eaba8f7ab50801ba578ffd0c3d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/trees/b9a176fc3ace7eaba8f7ab50801ba578ffd0c3d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/commits/cc4d72e024ca73f8ec2737f47ac50541bbb5c563","verification":{"payload":"tree b9a176fc3ace7eaba8f7ab50801ba578ffd0c3d8\nparent 73da7ff17720320cdc2d2d03cada24c78f5bbe02\nauthor Jeong-Sik Yun <45959991+jeong-sik@users.noreply.github.com> 1774186764 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774186764 +0900\n\nrefactor(stream): convert blocking Unix I/O to Eio.Path operations (#55)\n\nfile_response, file_inline, save_upload, and save_upload_with_progress\nused blocking Unix.openfile/Unix.read/Unix.write_substring which blocks\nthe entire Eio thread during file I/O. This converts them to use\nEio.Path.with_open_in/with_open_out via Fs_compat.get_fs() when the\nEio filesystem is available, with a fallback to the existing Unix calls\nfor test contexts where Fs_compat is not initialized.\n\nAlso extracts duplicated file-reading logic into read_file_to_stream.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpv/EMCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwIkQAG/yEGpslb12iFHHIzqlRqfH\npMHxU5cV6epSAFMK57WXZEOfscmYfCa8m4+9AdlPWzM+1qMTSrmpEuqK/399/uts\nb4NCkK2x5SMi0Rz1wGnvkx0vMUHnF5Vsj8BmwnKbc3DcWGYWZ7emABb+Bg3mga6e\nMWYO/FzSogCHj8bdhT9Cnc9lBB6wN8QVWfUEZNZ9xSwamAD2RrVAL1X8/VglTTyd\nEsn6XTRB6PflM3zZGLR3aOCALCzkIcKqPej6+pBFsyRx6X0vcllLjpf8u0oGvqwA\n2GmTQ5DoAAVYMKEQE/VtIbvv3E+Y0z3P64/tJbk7L4jrripclfwio72KXg+HDcgL\ns1LJXpWvCE05fOPJT6fuhqFGj6hVZNRp4lw/H5+TMp42gtbbLcQPcYtyqL1rk2IN\nVVDNDHit5bFKi0hjtHWJV4IUQ0pzstTLoDuxjnKLTDWyBLM3mv5Be5bJprKiu10S\nqyE8cJ5WaeyElBpSLX3cgo2DvG/xXQwqP20zp7JgDMpAtKDzugSo2LlOMIlQ8E22\nqYhv86a8h7u9f3XrRaZZNFosoa9GSSt+hDO1/iAnYThHs0mCKHPIUtO5J7RCVvFP\nTpCIi9LwFzb7i80r9Vel+USXL/RL37oCozmu7X3++G8xJN95vjvjMoqweTL1v3bM\nBideJ892jt77y+j68t0k\n=Z1hC\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-22T13:39:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.git