ming\noracle attacks. Replaced with Csrf.constant_time_compare which XORs\nall bytes before comparing.\n\nCloses #41.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpv3aGCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAG2wQAD7Oc5oEgD3w9ohNzLOyn4I2\nMfjHLamAuEzKAbEukR0/u7cEC+ziYvhoC+epFzI6qjvAihj5fCuKgbGyaseiBmQy\nqv3Dma/9zK4zORsffp04H6BT9v1s6NehhJk6LnEhD/ftZqz9ppg+2czpL5AWFXvD\nlaxVaYAus5SUx+2VDQpVy5zIm6XldqCI12R2+zep7lghTxn3j4cZC8vwfXD06VD0\n5D6tmbx7l5ZfrWB4VPI75evpvmTSyZqAa9A/gjNLDFgFoQaiGTtIbxNbQ4UKMsC4\nqGWvtvHQLYG2jMdSXRe0nqZw8cUKVeLBbTeqOkD/0TpQ7lMHMexCqgzni/dLUDya\n+o3oHwwjU0gnKo/El9NgNG/AMkNqhCKNGG1JWKqQWtPQAgOQ3pSJ00xRCzdbLnu4\ncn/iBm+ib40ohADjnvQ2SYoen14N/EJNxLfeIhf2xFd3ONBRTm7KZJhCJiWHNE0b\nLqVCc74gFdi7/Jr3t5Cjd2Iglx9R2kXSeQA0yLFhY+RqqCxhKzvuTQceFIDaQtrE\nc00H3Jm+iZwH2yrQmTZTF5qx/khfMj0N0XpHqR2jV7YlZ7gek4d2uCJW+nNVnus2\n8cy6ptU1h1uV+l5Lm9Ad57GQYheik5Ygn1dHfs87p76gP1L8KfuZbCwCk7IZwUR9\n8mJFs6DO474tAJ6DG73L\n=JIgg\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-22T04:56:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jeong-sik/kirin/commit/e442d9836ac4d7908d82a9a8aa644439231c2b0e","node_id":"C_kwDOQ_igeNoAKGU0NDJkOTgzNmFjNGQ3OTA4ZDgyYTlhOGFhNjQ0NDM5MjMxYzJiMGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jeong-sik/kirin/commit/1728f0b9fe66ae36c66c58541f3eefdb801ded45","sha":"1728f0b9fe66ae36c66c58541f3eefdb801ded45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/commits/1728f0b9fe66ae36c66c58541f3eefdb801ded45"}],"sha":"e442d9836ac4d7908d82a9a8aa644439231c2b0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/commits/e442d9836ac4d7908d82a9a8aa644439231c2b0e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45959991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeong-sik","id":45959991,"login":"jeong-sik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTU5OTkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/commits/1728f0b9fe66ae36c66c58541f3eefdb801ded45/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-22T03:50:57Z","email":"45959991+jeong-sik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeong-Sik Yun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-22T03:50:57Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: add Eio.Cancel.Cancelled guard to 14 unguarded exception catches (#37)\n\nWithout this guard, `Eio.Cancel.Cancelled` exceptions raised during\nfiber cancellation are silently caught and swallowed, preventing Eio\nfrom propagating cancellation through the fiber tree. This can cause\nfibers to hang or leak resources instead of shutting down cleanly.\n\nAffected modules (14 sites across 11 files):\n- server.ml: stream producer fork, worker run loop\n- shutdown.ml: hook runner, server_fn wrapper\n- middleware.ml: catch error handler\n- jobs.ml: job task execution\n- cluster.ml: worker entry_point\n- trace.ml: span error recording\n- metric_prometheus.ml: in-flight gauge tracking\n- stream.ml: progress error callback\n- grpc.ml: catch interceptor\n- astro/protocol.ml, qwik/protocol.ml: JSON parse catches\n\nIntentionally skipped: solid/worker.ml (2 sites) -- these run in\nforked Unix processes via Unix.fork, not in Eio fibers.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d0674614022d5e1dc1b56ea0d1f6cc589e78370e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/trees/d0674614022d5e1dc1b56ea0d1f6cc589e78370e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/commits/1728f0b9fe66ae36c66c58541f3eefdb801ded45","verification":{"payload":"tree d0674614022d5e1dc1b56ea0d1f6cc589e78370e\nparent 0ba040b0004e109bf76192f67b77e251c53c44db\nauthor Jeong-Sik Yun <45959991+jeong-sik@users.noreply.github.com> 1774151457 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774151457 +0900\n\nfix: add Eio.Cancel.Cancelled guard to 14 unguarded exception catches (#37)\n\nWithout this guard, `Eio.Cancel.Cancelled` exceptions raised during\nfiber cancellation are silently caught and swallowed, preventing Eio\nfrom propagating cancellation through the fiber tree. This can cause\nfibers to hang or leak resources instead of shutting down cleanly.\n\nAffected modules (14 sites across 11 files):\n- server.ml: stream producer fork, worker run loop\n- shutdown.ml: hook runner, server_fn wrapper\n- middleware.ml: catch error handler\n- jobs.ml: job task execution\n- cluster.ml: worker entry_point\n- trace.ml: span error recording\n- metric_prometheus.ml: in-flight gauge tracking\n- stream.ml: progress error callback\n- grpc.ml: catch interceptor\n- astro/protocol.ml, qwik/protocol.ml: JSON parse catches\n\nIntentionally skipped: solid/worker.ml (2 sites) -- these run in\nforked Unix processes via Unix.fork, not in Eio fibers.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpv2chCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAT4kQACidgo2NWuaD8C7k16puIk/4\nWMcAci0nNNydzcvi1PvI2yYwmil2dkkZX2O5MMyG+wg6DHgkNnagdTFLXdYJtyzc\nVixLNAfKlgIm/OlsNPwZEy6RqIcQKPHpC38JsZgHpYsUMDPZTy91xB/nvguSKdpF\nU5n69V3VNJGjYZFD5D77eX+WKDSRHlwqQMsqUjQpv0N3Vocg1C24fQkpm9LYr42A\n5lXseVI+ObIekdmviD848dEzj777ZnaWgAn55eqtFaCrfzX10Y8ZKe8EW5GQsaot\nQEyz2n1VDg172aNcRnET3U/Dr8NeNxzyaJt070teO8gVW8v2bpykg/dgAigBRqgZ\nZ54ufZSEcRnEqkHTBzdMuGB/T5BAgIhBTQdtRgD0ne5wNUSuf3i8/WrSFQw8rIau\nsplTesQIuvgQrrbTWvX1P7kcgmFFjwmZqWpdWPjluiQ9CbO3PIq6qTm+s8FPu6rY\nSgAPKcSAt47h54ve8a0bVRnLZTNP+apKH22eK5WceTlC3ANBsKaPPz3LOyoqp+II\nUEn/tiraR9AOMTkv/dUWvb82HlGmHQf1pc268XIg9DHo/hSxJCubqb4yrAQbOIgv\nMRKAfd2g9zT1DaGtu66mAg4beVrrzn85pAK9X9NBShmXB53qidwIaxYqM/+szvb4\nFS1SFUdqfZtkR2ODstJW\n=fTV8\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-22T03:50:59Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"http