6192f67b77e251c53c44db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-20T10:03:30Z","email":"45959991+jeong-sik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeong-Sik Yun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-20T10:03:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test: add dedicated tests for 7 core modules (cache, pool, websocket, sse, router, middleware, cookie) (#36)\n\n143 new tests covering under-tested core modules:\n- Cache (26): LRU+TTL, eviction, stats, StringCache/IntCache\n- Pool (18): acquire/release, use, lifecycle, validate_all\n- Websocket (29): opcode/close_code roundtrips, masking, encode/decode, RFC 6455 accept key\n- SSE (18): event encoding, multiline, broadcaster pub/sub, response_legacy\n- Router (21): parse_pattern, match_segments, dispatch, scope, method matching\n- Middleware (14): compose/pipeline, short-circuit, catch, CORS, timing\n- Cookie (17): parse, build_set_cookie, signed cookies (HMAC), delete\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"252ef600e19f674314567b646fcf18f19dc02b5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/trees/252ef600e19f674314567b646fcf18f19dc02b5b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/commits/0ba040b0004e109bf76192f67b77e251c53c44db","verification":{"payload":"tree 252ef600e19f674314567b646fcf18f19dc02b5b\nparent fde8a5e183ee1dab5be0ec52595710245fb3a927\nauthor Jeong-Sik Yun <45959991+jeong-sik@users.noreply.github.com> 1774001010 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774001010 +0900\n\ntest: add dedicated tests for 7 core modules (cache, pool, websocket, sse, router, middleware, cookie) (#36)\n\n143 new tests covering under-tested core modules:\n- Cache (26): LRU+TTL, eviction, stats, StringCache/IntCache\n- Pool (18): acquire/release, use, lifecycle, validate_all\n- Websocket (29): opcode/close_code roundtrips, masking, encode/decode, RFC 6455 accept key\n- SSE (18): event encoding, multiline, broadcaster pub/sub, response_legacy\n- Router (21): parse_pattern, match_segments, dispatch, scope, method matching\n- Middleware (14): compose/pipeline, short-circuit, catch, CORS, timing\n- Cookie (17): parse, build_set_cookie, signed cookies (HMAC), delete\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpvRtyCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAp40QAG8YwfoD8E8PYV1rFA3Bwt9h\nVDZwQjglomTNkOHBKCA97VZMob2yccZocZ8ruPHxNhBDx3/jmXS7rFxyWwL8g0mV\nlQG8fQZVlKw3uT8Yg5TYIWGy0Fvd+t29bjr21x+E/MpsCgdcRMiu/hb7fkM38bbt\neMRNIjAkqsNYhRP8yuvlTTxJzzgXD8oluE6nJhIwOyvH/1EZUMFkEI5LBsvouB2A\nr/mEUF42+u/HnToeA6A6tjyRPTokNvjyqvFJn+eo6bprI9jWi06BCEmDXawcMWIu\nsVZpL/ya33jhQIunKQgGwEqO9qNulnhFyvVZHMKxTaG+WXr9UD5+jWIZdmDzm/qo\nQT5NXVg5ioYVdJGA9RJ28GJ4Fe6lraYyWJMqvtHwDuYEkoxj0A9t8GKEr48+U+q7\nMwoArNRVCVIfvyBTebFjGDTfbgC+AUXMM4o7WYv/QpdJHL3CWb+nfkAF9DKYxyvt\nm2jpx8uU57+a8JtabcIH2DnjfDD0Rtu4ByJ8kRxIGvllbzJponkyY93jN+uRKTBz\nZaQWzlQbEAOn3e35wU+XhOYg0S7VT00EaNWnUFOtrqU7XS4Hj7dxQ5Vzap8lpGcc\n2wO27i98hZWp6B5DQbNYProokyUVGIYNVlnDYx57niLX4BZSYRUyuC4CfMk+HQYJ\n+vQ2yxATCw1+/iRo9Dna\n=vaSX\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-20T10:03:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/rep