/kirin/commit/fde8a5e183ee1dab5be0ec52595710245fb3a927","node_id":"C_kwDOQ_igeNoAKGZkZThhNWUxODNlZTFkYWI1YmUwZWM1MjU5NTcxMDI0NWZiM2E5Mjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jeong-sik/kirin/commit/2dfe1df78c69bbc921299d81c5118711562e2729","sha":"2dfe1df78c69bbc921299d81c5118711562e2729","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/commits/2dfe1df78c69bbc921299d81c5118711562e2729"}],"sha":"fde8a5e183ee1dab5be0ec52595710245fb3a927","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/commits/fde8a5e183ee1dab5be0ec52595710245fb3a927"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45959991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeong-sik","id":45959991,"login":"jeong-sik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTU5OTkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/commits/2dfe1df78c69bbc921299d81c5118711562e2729/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-20T08:00:04Z","email":"45959991+jeong-sik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeong-Sik Yun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-20T08:00:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: slim kirin.ml facade from 1105 to 247 lines (v1.4.0) (#34)\n\nRemove verbose odoc examples and redundant type re-exports from the\nfacade module. All convenience value aliases (ws_*, sse_*, template_*,\ntls_*, cookie helpers) remain for backward compatibility. The bulk\nreduction comes from eliminating per-section multi-line doc comments\nthat duplicated information already available in sub-module docs.\n\nWhat was removed from kirin.ml:\n- ~860 lines of inline odoc examples and section documentation\n- Type re-exports for pool_config, pool_stats, cache_stats,\n  job_priority, backpressure_strategy, ws_frame, ws_close_code,\n  sse_event, progress, health_status, shutdown_state, tls_config,\n  tls_error, template_context (accessible via Module.type)\n- Multipart convenience aliases (use Kirin.Multipart.*)\n\nWhat was kept:\n- All module re-exports (37 modules)\n- All high-frequency value aliases (request/response/routing/middleware)\n- WebSocket, SSE, streaming, cookie, template, TLS shortcuts\n- ws_opcode and webrtc_connection_state type re-exports (used in tests)\n- Graphql_relay (second-brain-graphql depends on it)\n- html_escape (svelte/solid sub-libraries depend on it)\n- Fs_compat, Time_compat (internal sub-libraries depend on them)\n\n1135 tests pass. No modules removed from the library.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f96767543f694b296d878f747e663730f2d0187a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/trees/f96767543f694b296d878f747e663730f2d0187a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/commits/2dfe1df78c69bbc921299d81c5118711562e2729","verification":{"payload":"tree f96767543f694b296d878f747e663730f2d0187a\nparent dbc30d1c7a192619991e481d129853022a3a322e\nauthor Jeong-Sik Yun <45959991+jeong-sik@users.noreply.github.com> 1773993604 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773993604 +0900\n\nrefactor: slim kirin.ml facade from 1105 to 247 lines (v1.4.0) (#34)\n\nRemove verbose odoc examples and redundant type re-exports from the\nfacade module. All convenience value aliases (ws_*, sse_*, template_*,\ntls_*, cookie helpers) remain for backward compatibility. The bulk\nreduction comes from eliminating per-section multi-line doc comments\nthat duplicated information already available in sub-module docs.\n\nWhat was removed from kirin.ml:\n- ~860 lines of inline odoc examples and section documentation\n- Type re-exports for pool_config, pool_stats, cache_stats,\n  job_priority, backpressure_strategy, ws_frame, ws_close_code,\n  sse_event, progress, health_status, shutdown_state, tls_config,\n  tls_error, template_context (accessible via Module.type)\n- Multipart convenience aliases (use Kirin.Multipart.*)\n\nWhat was kept:\n- All module re-exports (37 modules)\n- All high-frequency value aliases (request/response/routing/middleware)\n- WebSocket, SSE, streaming, cookie, template, TLS shortcuts\n- ws_opcode and webrtc_connection_state type re-exports (used in tests)\n- Graphql_relay (second-brain-graphql depends on it)\n- html_escape (svelte/solid sub-libraries depend on it)\n- Fs_compat, Time_compat (internal sub-libraries depend on them)\n\n1135 tests pass. No modules removed from the library.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpvP6FCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAF8YQACNLfb+hm1Mbb+6XVP7Mg5lE\nIsvhzGzk+OZRxAlNJRdee+TfQ4kShcUrtJBhX22WUJSGvoEnfWUGN5ISj1YBulHb\n5JgLGGTr9Hd80BmLD8qNeCyMXIdYevOi+rPTYik8dSEhSGQW3nJWrkBvHCQKwqZz\n/vdw2UWIB+qP9dcmzxc0J0/HustCmj5fuBCm6FPI3ZifIm70GzzCjGz86OiHVBxh\nms3YWaHqbdj2YzSWLwhhl8CHEN6VKUNaoGZQpWmPDfwT24ieCVeix+3rDRSVIcFw\nhY4yzsykk1PP4UGQXYETF4tJidpG0DPsQn7UQge/quoZfcehy8qyAVUYby847gBG\nxnJl655TMI/a46EYSfX5+LaUyNmIooyV1VtW5a0haU3Ds0aYPwiwn9dNvJGiEsTp\nO7oblxPehyJPoSvYsH8UCKsfkA76row/1YzfUXiEaqRCtifAf7D/BAQPZbV6nz4f\ncAo4x4ne6G0lVoBlEtKoUgzMu4OpaeCjE2lpiCLvo9aGLJRl8gsVEez/0E8g0ZAr\nRzu6aDADbcMkRxquKIXFgmBidxoV9Y6/sOF8Qft/YrmAQMEfw+NJZ7mN0Ab95LoL\n9faDca2C6vdXc671qdTjoSGwYVQr4CLNCPbIgEDB0NrLTSASwkrtGqiQQtyPJl9E\nHDxHfZkm