3.0.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0255ebb32f873bef6f857fa600fb4244f4445660","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/trees/0255ebb32f873bef6f857fa600fb4244f4445660"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/commits/dbc30d1c7a192619991e481d129853022a3a322e","verification":{"payload":"tree 0255ebb32f873bef6f857fa600fb4244f4445660\nparent 5179d6a6d47462305b7778bc54172c310ab79588\nauthor Jeong-Sik Yun <45959991+jeong-sik@users.noreply.github.com> 1773990412 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773990412 +0900\n\nfeat: complete .mli coverage for all 218 modules (v1.3.0) (#33)\n\nAdd .mli interface files for every remaining .ml module in the codebase,\nachieving 100% .mli coverage (218/218). Generated via ocaml-print-intf\nfrom .cmt build artifacts, then curated to fix internal module paths\n(Kirin__. -> public names) and hide internal helpers in key modules\n(shutdown.mli, template.mli).\n\nCoverage by area:\n- Core framework: kirin.mli (facade), template.mli, shutdown.mli,\n  metric_prometheus.mli, validation_*.mli, testing_*.mli, time_compat.mli,\n  version.mli\n- MCP (11): protocol, server, client, session, transport, tasks, jsonrpc,\n  schema, logging, governance, kirin_mcp\n- Auth (8): jwt, csrf, session, password, oauth2, auth_middleware,\n  secure_random, kirin_auth\n- Browser (1): kirin_browser (js_of_ocaml client-side framework)\n- SSR frameworks (128): react, vue, svelte, solid, preact, qwik, angular,\n  astro, alpine, htmx, lit, remix, tanstack, trpc (each with submodules)\n\nAll 1074 tests pass. Version bumped to 1.3.0.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpvPIMCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAASmMQAIq+tSKAvBiHBeI5h0WQB6fE\no4yFonHGQx73QZxESf/Vh6Ef1ZPd7fEi2aiGSoB0GEQSebRW4TLOD95DQTVYX/QS\ni6Lwv2PvtROkoCxs++BXz7KrtnRDvIWLex0Ixk0j75d1OUGpN924QPE01SmnViVK\nFxlFMU76bc0C9l+