repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/commits/e83ac3ced102188e24e11ed0e3ad4b790a13d11a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-20T05:30:17Z","email":"45959991+jeong-sik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeong-Sik Yun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-20T05:30:17Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add .mli interfaces for 10 core modules (v1.2.0) (#31)\n\n* feat: add .mli interfaces for 10 core modules (Phase 1 Week 1)\n\nAdd interface files for Tier 1 public API modules:\n- logger.mli: async structured logging with domain-safe queue\n- compress.mli: gzip/deflate response compression middleware\n- etag.mli: HTTP caching with ETag generation and conditional requests\n- health.mli: Kubernetes-style liveness/readiness probes\n- static.mli: static file serving with MIME detection and traversal protection\n- ratelimit.mli: token bucket rate limiting with pluggable storage\n- multipart.mli: multipart form-data parsing for file uploads\n- tls_config.mli: TLS/HTTPS PEM-based configuration\n- fs_compat.mli: Eio-native file I/O with blocking fallback\n- graphql_relay.mli: Relay-compliant GraphQL helpers (global IDs, connections)\n\nAll .mli files follow the project convention established by pool.mli and\ncache.mli: module doc comment, sectioned val declarations with odoc comments,\nabstract types where appropriate.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: bump version to 1.2.0\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8d7d25814c17df56334f775bd18126082bc6d467","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/trees/8d7d25814c17df56334f775bd18126082bc6d467"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/commits/e83ac3ced102188e24e11ed0e3ad4b790a13d11a","verification":{"payload":"tree 8d7d25814c17df56334f775bd18126082bc6d467\nparent 20125193e3caa0a34a58909f1fa1bd8333b6f0da\nauthor Jeong-Sik Yun <45959991+jeong-sik@users.noreply.github.com> 1773984617 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773984617 +0900\n\nfeat: add .mli interfaces for 10 core modules (v1.2.0) (#31)\n\n* feat: add .mli interfaces for 10 core modules (Phase 1 Week 1)\n\nAdd interface files for Tier 1 public API modules:\n- logger.mli: async structured logging with domain-safe queue\n- compress.mli: gzip/deflate response compression middleware\n- etag.mli: HTTP caching with ETag generation and conditional requests\n- health.mli: Kubernetes-style liveness/readiness probes\n- static.mli: static file serving with MIME detection and traversal protection\n- ratelimit.mli: token bucket rate limiting with pluggable storage\n- multipart.mli: multipart form-data parsing for file uploads\n- tls_config.mli: TLS/HTTPS PEM-based configuration\n- fs_compat.mli: Eio-native file I/O with blocking fallback\n- graphql_relay.mli: Relay-compliant GraphQL helpers (global IDs, connections)\n\nAll .mli files follow the project convention established by pool.mli and\ncache.mli: module doc comment, sectioned val declarations with odoc comments,\nabstract types where appropriate.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: bump version to 1.2.0\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpvNtpCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAz5AQACzAHmMwn6NyT1p7WpNvtsAs\nblT2Q5MFUrnui7MdyB6urCWwRuvz0JFUfSMirUDseORVlm9tOYgd+Bt9aTT