l":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/commits/20125193e3caa0a34a58909f1fa1bd8333b6f0da"}],"sha":"e83ac3ced102188e24e11ed0e3ad4b790a13d11a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/commits/e83ac3ced102188e24e11ed0e3ad4b790a13d11a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45959991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeong-sik","id":45959991,"login":"jeong-sik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTU5OTkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/commits/20125193e3caa0a34a58909f1fa1bd8333b6f0da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-20T04:25:15Z","email":"45959991+jeong-sik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeong-Sik Yun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-20T04:25:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: replace Stdlib.Mutex with Eio.Mutex in SSR/streaming modules (v1.1.0) (#30)\n\n* fix: replace Stdlib.Mutex with Eio.Mutex in SSR/streaming/subscription modules\n\nStdlib.Mutex blocks OS threads, causing EDEADLK risk when called from\nEio fibers. Convert vue/{ssr,streaming}, svelte/{ssr,streaming}, and\ntrpc/subscription from Mutex.protect to Eio.Mutex.use_rw.\n\nlogger.ml retains Stdlib.Mutex intentionally: it uses Domain.spawn for\na dedicated OS thread where cross-domain sync requires OS-level mutexes.\n\nTests that exercise Eio.Mutex now run under Eio_main.run context.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: bump version to 1.1.0\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1657819f3bfb26c68940d0f738aeb72c30df9e26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/trees/1657819f3bfb26c68940d0f738aeb72c30df9e26"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/commits/20125193e3caa0a34a58909f1fa1bd8333b6f0da","verification":{"payload":"tree 1657819f3bfb26c68940d0f738aeb72c30df9e26\nparent 179ff05c022c36187fb76fc1ce08767fcdcd5e76\nauthor Jeong-Sik Yun <45959991+jeong-sik@users.noreply.github.com> 1773980715 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773980715 +0900\n\nfix: replace Stdlib.Mutex with Eio.Mutex in SSR/streaming modules (v1.1.0) (#30)\n\n* fix: replace Stdlib.Mutex with Eio.Mutex in SSR/streaming/subscription modules\n\nStdlib.Mutex blocks OS threads, causing EDEADLK risk when called from\nEio fibers. Convert vue/{ssr,streaming}, svelte/{ssr,streaming}, and\ntrpc/subscription from Mutex.protect to Eio.Mutex.use_rw.\n\nlogger.ml retains Stdlib.Mutex intentionally: it uses Domain.spawn for\na dedicated OS thread where cross-domain sync requires OS-level mutexes.\n\nTests that exercise Eio.Mutex now run under Eio_main.run context.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: bump version to 1.1.0\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpvMwrCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAq78QAHOht6X0bS/XVTbTR2wfh8/p\n4lZKhikf2iv+Eja5C2jtVFtaZN1pKDpQ/RDae78wTHL0sHfVmndbNpLYaZgLatCM\n