thropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"210ed933f421d7ee347f292103c0b100e3c04c1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/trees/210ed933f421d7ee347f292103c0b100e3c04c1e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/commits/4521866150fe32c7893929cae92ca68f3fe12272","verification":{"payload":"tree 210ed933f421d7ee347f292103c0b100e3c04c1e\nparent 35418449e6991aa6e231ed8ec64e92e534067223\nauthor Jeong-Sik Yun <45959991+jeong-sik@users.noreply.github.com> 1771560832 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1771560832 +0900\n\nfix(mcp): replace weak session ID RNG with CSPRNG and add test coverage (#17)\n\nSession IDs now use /dev/urandom (128-bit entropy, 32 hex chars) instead\nof predictable Random.bits(). Adds 14 new tests covering Transport (6),\nClient (3), Tasks edge cases (3), and Session ID properties (2).\n\nMCP test count: 52 → 66.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpl9+ACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA0mQQAK17z8djWy9tSILFSXXrqxei\nEdegmlRPUS15wyW1wxJu5oSBWxDaY2b+PoXyp9PtWggzf8CPkkUW9L2xuaQDLGNR\n6RTW66E9OGiQIAsWruzOnNjfq7NyCDBs4DrKKLHpodwXh4pHkGvTddDm/fhaVAtS\n1aC4hnscLHldEfbTfbpvVDlRL24lmFGSuPET+/YnuuHBps/HV+LGh2YM/VXVLrVb\nWMVY1uoeNtp4l8+Q22BDP+QfVUFNPx+e4R98tKOtAOwP6LuXJDmWH62+LjOWTvMm\nmnw5yhTfFyyYjQlWey9n+vAWXf72anRsxmmuX9oOb1QAwRNUF3BW05d6dzeg02UQ\nCTQRLTqCwIkSpQKtxVC9Tf1a1u8XeFsS14TcRtWW3pinO2FPzDGzSvilXwG8zJ6t\nADJhTBNjxLUSYxRGuy/CUFm2kdCjA3VfIJO/AErUvfqlJf3cjR11KeRTXHPlL9uM\nteJcWX4/wY+KTPRdxCHAaiB1RrhDIBd5mRR0LakEXqpg1yhvXsxAvJTGnCn+QIBO\nebZlB/7WLaOsJL4F24S8vyE8RZVCN7acvv6R+/TpSma61bqkJ4JHPnbnsfptHPyP\nX8pdkvBbh4MxDUoDSe5fE2Js8atdbszWnLiHDS05DMzfphR2cKE45ljkVZqkPhGh\nWknLV9yBsdd047V2HuBh\n=WkF5\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-02-20T04:13:52Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":