vents","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/commits/35418449e6991aa6e231ed8ec64e92e534067223/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-19T12:54:56Z","email":"45959991+jeong-sik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeong-Sik Yun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-19T12:54:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(mcp): implement Streamable HTTP transport for 2025-11-25 spec (#16)\n\nReplace legacy HTTP+SSE two-endpoint transport with Streamable HTTP\nsingle-endpoint architecture (/mcp). This aligns with the MCP 2025-11-25\nspecification for transport layer compliance.\n\nChanges in mcp_adapter.ml:\n- Add session_header constant and is_initialize_request helper\n- Add validate_session for Mcp-Session-Id header enforcement\n- Add with_session_header to attach session ID to responses\n- POST handler validates session ID for non-initialize requests\n- GET handler uses Sse.Broadcaster for server-initiated notifications\n- DELETE handler for session termination (begin_shutdown + complete_shutdown)\n- OPTIONS handler updated with DELETE method and Mcp-Session-Id CORS headers\n- All routes unified on single prefix (removed /mcp/sse sub-path)\n\nTests: 5 new adapter tests (session header, init detection for single/batch/\nnon-init/malformed JSON). MCP suite now 52 tests, all passing.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9a449e3ea631ca1ae538417d2113298cf350e1a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/trees/9a449e3ea631ca1ae538417d2113298cf350e1a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/commits/35418449e6991aa6e231ed8ec64e92e534067223","verification":{"payload":"tree 9a449e3ea631ca1ae538417d2113298cf350e1a0\nparent 0fc13682713bb934a3a910d838d78a1c683ccbc1\nauthor Jeong-Sik Yun <45959991+jeong-sik@users.noreply.github.com> 1771505696 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1771505696 +0900\n\nfix(mcp): implement Streamable HTTP transport for 2025-11-25 spec (#16)\n\nReplace legacy HTTP+SSE two-endpoint transport with Streamable HTTP\nsingle-endpoint architecture (/mcp). This aligns with the MCP 2025-11-25\nspecification for transport layer compliance.\n\nChanges in mcp_adapter.ml:\n- Add session_header constant and is_initialize_request helper\n- Add validate_session for Mcp-Session-Id header enforcement\n- Add with_session_header to attach session ID to responses\n- POST handler validates session ID for non-initialize requests\n- GET handler uses Sse.Broadcaster for server-initiated notifications\n- DELETE handler for session termination (begin_shutdown + complete_shutdown)\n- OPTIONS handler updated with DELETE method and Mcp-Session-Id CORS headers\n- All routes unified on single prefix (removed /mcp/sse sub-path)\n\nTests: 5 new adapter tests (session header, init detection for single/batch/\nnon-init/malformed JSON). MCP suite now 52 tests, all passing.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJplwggCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9HIQAGBqO545pipaKCwQSPTu0fG6\nXxqaDhaUgFZAzj7ROIml50EgjttKyGH6FLiFKqVtBEsFGlB+WcEnMA5JSeX2jBUh\nYSf5Cq5vbDJ6mGXYdf4vA208JE+p/lgJIKAfolF+/zZNBwSr7MC3u0JfqMPA4UA2\nmI5Q2cixi5nCfuQGLLSB+aRLOrNmhZGfSUckI/VmqgEXIicGinkspQ/npt9byxlZ\nyyaVh+B6/arnzoDyz/AnDEFZg9keJOFwZCO42FrCP24+6zsEB4UZ6fm+UuqwwuHu\npWU/gnfL6uSVy1gvt8RgqWF3sud9AYtFIFBCkCRInCNIiYBoaqr9BbhAiceHDO9+\nyf3WKB0PaVVDRvtv6y+6g/rX7iOvOsSGvySICqt5kIjHT5C5YBJHkeAyChwkTIVn\nf/ol8lgJiF8xkDK/ssTOcgTF6nqw/Hbs8l+ETFDIf2Dp46OfAuKEHXnrHMFBEOnG\nduW3rdb9iMdYHMU7zHDnIxPQjtPv4IArWn86fYtNTwA3ZYsG+GdMOcXyyu8jPH++\nwMFa+DcmPzZxafwaJWeBr1PVyrT