user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/commits/551d60df92265fbd852956fe5e77265c72b288d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-19T06:10:59Z","email":"45959991+jeong-sik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeong-Sik Yun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-19T06:10:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci: add timeout-minutes to benchmark job (#10)\n\nWithout an explicit timeout, the benchmark job falls back to GitHub''s\ndefault 360-minute (6 hour) limit. If opam downloads hang or the\nbenchmark enters an unexpected state, the run shows no conclusion\nfor hours. A 15-minute cap gives ample headroom for the ~4 min\nbenchmark while ensuring timely termination.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"769f6c15cb9deff4ffd66a7478cf1b5739e27bea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/trees/769f6c15cb9deff4ffd66a7478cf1b5739e27bea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/commits/551d60df92265fbd852956fe5e77265c72b288d4","verification":{"payload":"tree 769f6c15cb9deff4ffd66a7478cf1b5739e27bea\nparent c43b5dcebaf3f0a5fbf71a624109f5ea8516974c\nauthor Jeong-Sik Yun <45959991+jeong-sik@users.noreply.github.com> 1771481459 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1771481459 +0900\n\nci: add timeout-minutes to benchmark job (#10)\n\nWithout an explicit timeout, the benchmark job falls back to GitHub''s\ndefault 360-minute (6 hour) limit. If opam downloads hang or the\nbenchmark enters an unexpected state, the run shows no conclusion\nfor hours. A 15-minute cap gives ample headroom for the ~4 min\nbenchmark while ensuring timely termination.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJplqlzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAlwIQAJ681g7piwS9fhBksUl0xL59\nTChjewFe044wQ/kmc87z/zdbkoZm7Lj2FOEDt5RuVbTwkzWAFOcjaecttKVBDwq1\nAg+jNtPAx/8nWQG3tXnRLG/oZL4egsk