l":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/commits/c06359ae776d42cf67b2bc06748e0193db21920f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-19T05:18:21Z","email":"45959991+jeong-sik@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Jeong-Sik Yun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-19T05:18:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: strip leading slash from static relative paths (#8)\n\nRoot cause: Filename.concat treats paths starting with ''/'' as absolute,\ncausing `Filename.concat \"/app/static\" \"/css/styles.css\"` to return\n\"/css/styles.css\" instead of \"/app/static/css/styles.css\".\n\nWhen prefix=\"/static\" and path=\"/static/css/styles.css\":\n- relative_path after substring extraction: \"/css/styles.css\" (leading /)\n- Filename.concat ignores dir argument → file not found\n\nFix: Strip leading ''/'' from relative_path before Filename.concat.\n\nAlso added common font MIME types (.woff2, .ttf, .eot, .webp).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8f6c7ab33377bb86edc274eb20ee3978382eef66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/trees/8f6c7ab33377bb86edc274eb20ee3978382eef66"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/commits/c06359ae776d42cf67b2bc06748e0193db21920f","verification":{"payload":"tree 8f6c7ab33377bb86edc274eb20ee3978382eef66\nparent 2b532bfcfeefc0c0a03cf5357a9c6793752d2fcb\nauthor Jeong-Sik Yun <45959991+jeong-sik@users.noreply.github.com> 1771478301 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1771478301 +0900\n\nfix: strip leading slash from static relative paths (#8)\n\nRoot cause: Filename.concat treats paths starting with ''/'' as absolute,\ncausing `Filename.concat \"/app/static\" \"/css/styles.css\"` to return\n\"/css/styles.css\" instead of \"/app/static/css/styles.css\".\n\nWhen prefix=\"/static\" and path=\"/static/css/styles.css\":\n- relative_path after substring extraction: \"/css/styles.css\" (leading /)\n- Filename.concat ignores dir argument → file not found\n\nFix: Strip leading ''/'' from relative_path before Filename.concat.\n\nAlso added common font MIME types (.woff2, .ttf, .eot, .webp).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJplp0dCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAALmoQAJZ1FVTFs8gNgnLevsHBHI0C\nVMsyNsQPP7vuYZNW053Rg+aHQq/fLrJ/fEuSGjujmnIrw7ldWRqndPQdjsw3K6Bw\npNndknZpiNHAfhy1nXeaU3pakPvngQyb2RjXdHhOlIA8fnMnIz45EftBPvknZXJG\nKzpwgmHcTBcNm7exC+krIPwIIK2iIVSQei9TilBgU6aP8Ml3HdeOwKVnsoetQIhV\noMNuCVRx2cWiC4oQl7auLdHW3YsxXsKKAijrS4b4dxmaxn4KvUC8oanM23Awdp6h\niaI3Wj+H901mNpsmAA2lkXHnUHATw+CH7vrXyaU/naIcyQwCwqGe2Cy4gWK/7pHq\n+W+/75tgNifcbf7IHVF0AfLtF6folFzhAFasYYJdKHbXppz7DX1BN6W8ca6+/RLN\ncQBsyElgiNSNY6LDUsxSHz+g4l9asbmlOFXoJJcNftlWUMN1fi8nH8nJ24OIkX+l\nKf0XcMevJh46yAycHje1uDFOhEJItKtiCi72f5yQEQ+xq647fs4eyrs5mLUC3lv6\nznNV/m3MJwr6a1TsOzqlXDMrBjdBCzlzsOrRGxBEr3c5ltecEkqUSM4O2CZbwGcg\nbSAQXj6NrdaUTPUYlceuCJPoTkaJj952QkflffGjxU1se2fDhayWce739twsbVcD\njF/LiFoLdvvxeY43387e\n=oULv\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-02-19T05:18:22Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_u