d_timeout (default 5s) to prevent infinite stream blocking\n- Use Eio.Time.with_timeout for proper timeout handling\n- Return 504 Gateway Timeout on request timeout\n- Log warnings when timeouts occur\n- Update config type with new timeout fields\n- Expose timeout parameters in Kirin.start for user configuration\n\nThis prevents scenarios where a single hanging request (like a Docker\nHEALTHCHECK) can block the entire server.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1cf8f22fd77ac89940ee32b5d55ba49f06290264","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/trees/1cf8f22fd77ac89940ee32b5d55ba49f06290264"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/commits/c2c6ba609ef390071524adf76d8b138b137695fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45959991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeong-sik","id":45959991,"login":"jeong-sik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTU5OTkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jeong-sik/kirin/commit/c2c6ba609ef390071524adf76d8b138b137695fd","node_id":"C_kwDOQ_igeNoAKGMyYzZiYTYwOWVmMzkwMDcxNTI0YWRmNzZkOGIxMzhiMTM3Njk1ZmQ",