"jeong-sik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-02T08:24:02Z","email":"yousleepwhen@gmail.com","name":"jeong-sik"},"message":"feat(io): add Fs_compat for Eio-native file I/O\n\nAdd Fs_compat module providing Eio-native file operations with\nblocking Unix fallback for gradual migration:\n- Fs_compat.load / load_binary (read files)\n- Fs_compat.save (write files)\n- Fs_compat.file_exists / is_directory / readdir\n\nIntegration:\n- server.ml / grpc.ml: inject fs at Eio_main.run startup\n- kirin.ml: re-export Fs_compat for submodules\n\nConverted 19 files from blocking I/O to Fs_compat:\n- i18n.ml, tls_config.ml, static.ml, testing.ml\n- react/: manifest.ml, assets.ml, vite.ml\n- angular/: handler.ml\n- astro/: handler.ml, ssr.ml\n- preact/: manifest.ml\n- qwik/: handler.ml, ssr.ml\n- svelte/: manifest.ml, codegen.ml\n- vue/: manifest.ml\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3b979328f1d487422e96b1e1f475ffa4b21b12f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/trees/3b979328f1d487422e96b1e1f475ffa4b21b12f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeong-sik/kirin/git/commits/5c34565c483c984f5a67dc6c1875780827bb0d9c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45959991?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeong-sik","id":45959991,"login":"jeong-sik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTU5OTkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeong-sik/repos","site_admi