FiZWQxOTExZjRlMmYwYzgxYjEyZGUyNzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/platform-mesh/provider-quickstart/commit/904a1c4f97749e7128ba77a2fafdc73fea7844a0","sha":"904a1c4f97749e7128ba77a2fafdc73fea7844a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/provider-quickstart/commits/904a1c4f97749e7128ba77a2fafdc73fea7844a0"}],"sha":"98287f2caf17c381bed1911f4e2f0c81b12de271","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/provider-quickstart/commits/98287f2caf17c381bed1911f4e2f0c81b12de271"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3225744?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mjudeikis","id":3225744,"login":"mjudeikis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjU3NDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/provider-quickstart/commits/904a1c4f97749e7128ba77a2fafdc73fea7844a0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T08:45:36Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T13:31:36Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"message":"feat(pm): pin kcp front-proxy via hostAliases, IP set through kustomize\n\nThe wildwest-controller''s endpoint watcher dials the APIExport virtual-workspace\nURL (https://root.kcp.localhost:8443/...) directly. Inside the pod that hostname\nresolves to 127.0.0.1, so the watch fails with connection refused.\n\nEnable common.hostAliases on the controller to pin *.kcp.localhost to the\nin-cluster front-proxy service. The ClusterIP is environment-specific, so it is\nexposed as the single editable field via a kustomize JSON patch in\nkustomization.yaml rather than hardcoded in the manifest.\n\nSigned-off-by: Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt>","tree":{"sha":"8960064260d9c781b5c0b2cb6e014665b5915c1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/provider-quickstart/git/trees/8960064260d9c781b5c0b2cb6e014665b5915c1f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/provider-quickstart/git/commits/904a1c4f97749e7128ba77a2fafdc73fea7844a0","verification":{"payload":"tree 8960064260d9c781b5c0b2cb6e014665b5915c1f\nparent 726fd64ee969b549f49b7ac8755403aee6b14d62\nauthor Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt> 1782722736 +0300\ncommitter Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt> 1782739896 +0300\n\nfeat(pm): pin kcp front-proxy via hostAliases, IP set through kustomize\n\nThe wildwest-controller''s endpoint watcher dials the APIExport virtual-workspace\nURL (https://root.kcp.localhost:8443/...) directly. Inside the pod that hostname\nresolves to 127.0.0.1, so the watch fails with connection refused.\n\nEnable common.hostAliases on the controller to pin *.kcp.localhost to the\nin-cluster front-proxy service. The ClusterIP is environment-specific, so it is\nexposed as the single editable field via a kustomize JSON patch in\nkustomization.yaml rather than hardcoded in the manifest.\n\nSigned-off-by: Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJPBAABCAA5FiEEMtV72CeF+eCb0QAlQ+sIBvLbYkcFAmpCc7gbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEEPrCAby22JHjRYQAMf3HJdDoLivXnCjw9OO\noZa7ZgunptR0ZkB7lOu23GBsnAbwIG6XN7mqcehraPKkBpByQEgGhvmd1V2GI5RI\nGo474Ua4+oqW1IyTxSMlfMP