403aee6b14d62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/provider-quickstart/commits/726fd64ee969b549f49b7ac8755403aee6b14d62"}],"sha":"904a1c4f97749e7128ba77a2fafdc73fea7844a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/provider-quickstart/commits/904a1c4f97749e7128ba77a2fafdc73fea7844a0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3225744?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mjudeikis","id":3225744,"login":"mjudeikis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjU3NDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/provider-quickstart/commits/726fd64ee969b549f49b7ac8755403aee6b14d62/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T09:01:53Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T09:01:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(pm): point ManagedProvider config at published v0.0.7 charts (#669)\n\n* docs(pm): bump ManagedProvider chart references to v0.0.7\n\nThe provider-quickstart Helm charts are now published at v0.0.7 under\nghcr.io/platform-mesh/provider-quickstart/charts (first release including the\npublish-helm CI job from #668). Point the config/pm ManagedProvider manifest\nand docs at the published version.\n\nSigned-off-by: Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt>\n\n* feat(pm): pin kcp front-proxy via hostAliases, IP set through kustomize\n\nThe wildwest-controller''s endpoint watcher dials the APIExport virtual-workspace\nURL (https://root.kcp.localhost:8443/...) directly. Inside the pod that hostname\nresolves to 127.0.0.1, so the watch fails with connection refused.\n\nEnable common.hostAliases on the controller to pin *.kcp.localhost to the\nin-cluster front-proxy service. The ClusterIP is environment-specific, so it is\nexposed as the single editable field via a kustomize JSON patch in\nkustomization.yaml rather than hardcoded in the manifest.\n\nSigned-off-by: Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt>\n\n* feat(pm): deploy wildwest-armament-sync via ManagedProvider\n\nAdd the armament syncer as a third runtimeDeployments component. It connects to\nkcp through the provider workspace kubeconfig, so it gets the same\nwildwest-provider-kubeconfig override and *.kcp.localhost hostAliases pinning as\nthe controller; the front-proxy IP is patched for both via kustomization.yaml.\n\nSigned-off-by: Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt>\n\n* ci: build and publish the armament-sync image\n\nThe wildwest-armament-sync chart referenced\nghcr.io/platform-mesh/provider-quickstart-armament-sync, but no CI job ever built\nthat image, so deploying the chart fails with ImagePullBackOff.\n\nAdd a build-armament-sync job (mirroring build-controller, using\ndeploy/armament-sync.Dockerfile) and gate publish-helm on it. Default the chart''s\nimage.tag to the appVersion so the released chart (packaged with\n--app-version=<release tag>) pulls the matching image tag the job publishes.\n\nSigned-off-by: Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt>","tree":{"sha":"114d9034d47e91913883a7225d8fead9279196e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/provider-quickstart/git/trees/114d9034d47e91913883a7225d8fead9279196e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/provider-quickstart/git/commits/726fd64ee969b549f49b7ac8755403aee6b14d62","verification":{"payload":"tree 114d9034d47e91913883a7225d8fead9279196e0\nparent dea3b476825901c73d20524954aa0c277703cfad\nauthor Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt> 1782723713 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782723713 +0300\n\ndocs(pm): point ManagedProvider config at published v0.0.7 charts (#669)\n\n* docs(pm): bump ManagedProvider chart references to v0.0.7\n\nThe provider-quickstart Helm charts are now published at v0.0.7 under\nghcr.io/platform-mesh/provider-quickstart/charts (first release including the\npublish-helm CI job from #668). Point the config/pm ManagedProvider manifest\nand docs at the published version.\n\nSigned-off-by: Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt>\n\n* feat(pm): pin kcp front-proxy via hostAliases, IP set through kustomize\n\nThe wildwest-controller''s endpoint watcher dials the APIExport virtual-workspace\nURL (https://root.kcp.localhost:8443/...) directly. Inside the pod that hostname\nresolves to 127.0.0.1, so the watch fails with connection refused.\n\nEnable common.hostAliases on the controller to pin *.kcp.localhost to the\nin-cluster front-proxy service. The ClusterIP is environment-specific, so it is\nexposed as the single editable field via a kustomize JSON patch in\nkustomization.yaml rather than hardcoded in the manifest.\n\nSigned-off-by: Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt>\n\n* feat(pm): deploy wildwest-armament-sync via ManagedProvider\n\nAdd the armament syncer as a third runtimeDeployments component. It connects to\nkcp through the provider workspace kubeconfig, so it gets the same\nwildwest-provider-kubeconfig override and *.kcp.localhost hostAliases pinning as\nthe controller; the front-proxy IP is patched for both via kustomization.yaml.\n\nSigned-off-by: Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt>\n\n* ci: build and publish the armament-sync image\n\nThe wildwest-armament-sync chart referenced\nghcr.io/platform-mesh/provider-quickstart-armament-sync, but no CI job ever built\nthat image, so deploying the chart fails with ImagePullBackOff.\n\nAdd a build-armament-sync job (mirroring build-controller, using\ndeploy/armament-sync.Dockerfile) and gate publish-helm on it. Default the chart''s\nimage.tag to the appVersion so the released chart (packaged with\n--app-version=<release tag>) pulls the matching image tag the job publishes.\n\nSigned-off-by: Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqQjSBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAaRsQAHLEspCzJ/Jsbi05kyvnifjT\n7unmwv2o0/vbMz2MOrhdQXPVMqPiQypTnQGi3lLkke+dUxvD57nieWi34fhvTa4J\nW1PdcE0KuqhXyJ1ZiUmLloPErTObJYbpvJuB8kPrQs/8lkeaAx498zPTyLkjJ9Al\nLFr7ZYqqA5F3B2fA3hUT7H7RJT5fIF/vHcxS2pNNemgskOCQOMaMIUkKX6098IPh\navNRz2xSh20lVvCBvRmC8q/UHVLxOFG3/1Xrfu+OB8ZNU65IdkYVjZCuxYhq3RyF\n5a+Y5uotOsVge7LKW45NeUZ63sbRFEYiZFAnbqmMiScA9MYtwGbH1Q/lOT/nO3j8\nL2ZrAyN9pw9FccNDjqq36+5vEBMWOGemmP1slxJh0arBi7ykIQrputTnTFt0F+yx\nfXbuZ2DxR6ju4odwUKWUS7KoUiqnU37kOfudyO3rImBmON+vOB78963ddH9/Lz9a\nf0m44FK1rO5wRM4LKr8IcWVZ/rTjIiKXMIz+60ZtETpV8O6p+bRzBAXwptM7PopM\ne7gegDW3Sy5VVKANAo2xWwkwiL/IusPakhKux8F0+92y0PfsUtILT2ETmLl2E+dj\nSyBGb2qccnNEfaOy1tsFvB/VA2BlncGJNLzGqMoCH2VHRA8fCKpVvFcMAybniwjL\n2HIMsVXfzg9mhh1ux9Gy\n=kxm/\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-29T09:01:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/platform-mesh/provider-quickstart/commit/726fd64ee969b549f49b7ac8755403aee6b14d62","node_id":"C_kwDOQ_soDtoAKDcyNmZkNjRlZTk2OWI1NDlmNDliN2FjODc1NTQwM2FlZTZiMTRkNjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/platform-mesh/provider-quickstart/commit/dea3b476825901c73d20524954aa0c277703cfad","sha":"dea3b476825901c73d20524954aa0c277703cfad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/provider-quickstart/commits/dea3b476825901c73d20524954aa0c277703cfad"}],"sha":"726fd64ee969b549f49b7ac8755403aee6b14d62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/provider-quickstart/commits/726fd64ee969b549f49b7ac8755403aee6b14d62"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3225744?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mjudeikis","id":3225744,"login":"mjudeikis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjU3NDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/provider-quickstart/commits/dea3b476825901c73d20524954aa0c277703cfad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T08:07:56Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T08:07:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci: publish Wild West Helm charts as OCI artifacts (#668)\n\nThe platform-mesh-operator ManagedProvider machinery deploys provider\ncomponents via Flux OCIRepository -> HelmRelease, which requires the charts\nto be published as standalone OCI Helm chart artifacts (it cannot resolve\ncharts out of the bundled OCM component descriptor).\n\nAdd a helm-push Make target and a publish-helm CI job that package and push\nthe wildwest-controller, wildwest-portal and wildwest-armament-sync charts on\nevery v* tag, versioned from the release tag (matching the existing image/OCM\npublish flow). Charts go under this repo''s own GHCR namespace\n(ghcr.io/platform-mesh/provider-quickstart/charts) so the provider is\nself-contained, rather than the shared helm-charts registry.\n\nAlso add config/pm/ with a ready-to-apply ManagedProvider manifest plus docs\ndescribing how to bootstrap the quickstart provider through the operator.\n\nSigned-off-by: Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt>","tree":{"sha":"f95a0b14b2cb2a77fbb602c3e249ef5efe3a9b3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/provider-quickstart/git/trees/f95a0b14b2cb2a77fbb602c3e249ef5efe3a9b3e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/provider-quickstart/git/commits/dea3b476825901c73d20524954aa0c277703cfad","verification":{"payload":"tree f95a0b14b2cb2a77fbb602c3e249ef5efe3a9b3e\nparent d1a3a1661070b04424b70bc5cbe612064cd59b7d\nauthor Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt> 1782720476 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782720476 +0200\n\nci: publish Wild West Helm charts as OCI artifacts (#668)\n\nThe platform-mesh-operator ManagedProvider machinery deploys provider\ncomponents via Flux OCIRepository -> HelmRelease, which requires the charts\nto be published as standalone OCI Helm chart artifacts (it cannot resolve\ncharts out of the bundled OCM component descriptor).\n\nAdd a helm-push Make target and a publish-helm CI job that package and push\nthe wildwest-controller, wildwest-portal and wildwest-armament-sync charts on\nevery v* tag, versioned from the release tag (matching the existing image/OCM\npublish flow). Charts go under this repo''s own GHCR namespace\n(ghcr.io/platform-mesh/provider-quickstart/charts) so the provider is\nself-contained, rather than the shared helm-charts registry.\n\nAlso add config/pm/ with a ready-to-apply ManagedProvider manifest plus docs\ndescribing how to bootstrap the quickstart provider through the operator.\n\nSigned-off-by: Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqQifcCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAK3IQAHix5WOExCf875u9uG7N0Kaz\nhZYvtcpW6Vv7mmh9Tuzmu2t6d9wKHS0IuwijI4nQdUyaNyi4VGft1O5Je0sIaLWW\nI4cOKuB4qnevQyvalHInkQFf3DluXCRAnshx8zE/ZDzNGIRrhEbMGymSpFyuGqLf\nhWDhVW9khfAWryxW+wYTK37Y3+3F9Rr2kZS0KYKk4dKXOhTIJvmhxVTST6pknAzf\nXaqq3xDFxYMMH6JOU4SYd7WhPypZeeafSAAzjcIegywGmH94qTjx11sLz3r9NKyN\n1Ub7vZAA9LULNMLcMgP/7mB0KGlF4rx9NZ7ngC0f28Ytj0vg+NpB9UA7U6Wj+d0D\ngpuL1BiAAeM5UviFctTjeopauGYt96mUB7q3hDtVUiunJXi1Ls7HVryvIQN5sf/N\nsvEXiqLN1q+msoBehtIynuT86sbMorJOpTwOwe0Dlpy/OIzNpOw67D+nZVByGXNz\nqkXSazTxJBgiwiSalxqVIGuNMCdhwIaleiDwNHThUyBE430O78YSt7VAStP76taQ\nVTeC8zodWBh977j0sMie7Wq3/a6tx8qR3KXIpVFavEvStqEq4om6xbO4XznCoUR7\njlxqjXza0bhbR3idTmi0tD+or87Qmhf7mq9DORmoRINWuZNtZ2VgW4naM5UtmL19\nbMWOuANGY+PN1N3bLSwS\n=g/8G\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-29T08:07:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?