fd320ae204a0b6123609b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/provider-quickstart/commits/0ceab454155e4b7779fd320ae204a0b6123609b6"}],"sha":"6a3d24abf41aacf059c641cf58afd886a608b36d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/provider-quickstart/commits/6a3d24abf41aacf059c641cf58afd886a608b36d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3225744?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mjudeikis","id":3225744,"login":"mjudeikis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjU3NDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/provider-quickstart/commits/0ceab454155e4b7779fd320ae204a0b6123609b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T10:34:19Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T10:34:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ocm): declare source repo so GHCR auto-links packages (#643)\n\nHelm charts and the OCM component-descriptor are pushed to GHCR as OCI\nartifacts. Without an org.opencontainers.image.source annotation on the\nmanifest, GHCR has no way to link the resulting org package back to the\nprovider-quickstart repo, which leaves the package dangling and blocks\nthe workflow''s GITHUB_TOKEN from writing subsequent versions.\n\n- Add sources: to both Chart.yaml files; Helm propagates sources[0] as\n  org.opencontainers.image.source on the chart manifest.\n- Add labels and a git source block on the OCM component so the same\n  annotation lands on the component-descriptor manifest.\n\nExisting dangling packages will need to be deleted and re-pushed once for\nthe annotation to apply; after that CI can write.\n\nSigned-off-by: Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt>","tree":{"sha":"5a42151bd032b34f897df62327130f6e900a3b97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/provider-quickstart/git/trees/5a42151bd032b34f897df62327130f6e900a3b97"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/provider-quickstart/git/commits/0ceab454155e4b7779fd320ae204a0b6123609b6","verification":{"payload":"tree 5a42151bd032b34f897df62327130f6e900a3b97\nparent 47397e95770beb8a5681bf5d2df97d333f2e16a5\nauthor Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt> 1780050859 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780050859 +0200\n\nfix(ocm): declare source repo so GHCR auto-links packages (#643)\n\nHelm charts and the OCM component-descriptor are pushed to GHCR as OCI\nartifacts. Without an org.opencontainers.image.source annotation on the\nmanifest, GHCR has no way to link the resulting org package back to the\nprovider-quickstart repo, which leaves the package dangling and blocks\nthe workflow''s GITHUB_TOKEN from writing subsequent versions.\n\n- Add sources: to both Chart.yaml files; Helm propagates sources[0] as\n  org.opencontainers.image.source on the chart manifest.\n- Add labels and a git source block on the OCM component so the same\n  annotation lands on the component-descriptor manifest.\n\nExisting dangling packages will need to be deleted and re-pushed once for\nthe annotation to apply; after that CI can write.\n\nSigned-off-by: Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcB