:"https://github.com/platform-mesh/provider-quickstart/commit/47397e95770beb8a5681bf5d2df97d333f2e16a5","sha":"47397e95770beb8a5681bf5d2df97d333f2e16a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/provider-quickstart/commits/47397e95770beb8a5681bf5d2df97d333f2e16a5"}],"sha":"0ceab454155e4b7779fd320ae204a0b6123609b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/provider-quickstart/commits/0ceab454155e4b7779fd320ae204a0b6123609b6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3225744?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mjudeikis","id":3225744,"login":"mjudeikis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjU3NDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjudeikis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/provider-quickstart/commits/47397e95770beb8a5681bf5d2df97d333f2e16a5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T09:23:59Z","email":"mangirdas@judeikis.lt","name":"Mangirdas Judeikis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T09:23:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Wire in OCM (#641)\n\n* Wire in ocm\n\nSigned-off-by: Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt>\n\n* fix(deps): bump multicluster-provider for client-go v0.36 compat\n\nmulticluster-provider v0.7.1 and its transitive apimachinery/v2 v2.31.x\npredate the cache.Informer/Controller interface change that added\nHasSyncedChecker and the new PopBatch signature in client-go v0.36,\nwhich is what the kubernetes monorepo update (#632) pulled in. Bumping\nmulticluster-provider to its main pseudo-version brings in a newer\napimachinery and unbreaks the build.\n\nSigned-off-by: Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt>","tree":{"sha":"c10cfedeb7bd20bf9b4fe7fcab3414cd3fa3f6a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/provider-quickstart/git/trees/c10cfedeb7bd20bf9b4fe7fcab3414cd3fa3f6a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platform-mesh/provider-quickstart/git/commits/47397e95770beb8a5681bf5d2df97d333f2e16a5","verification":{"payload":"tree c10cfedeb7bd20bf9b4fe7fcab3414cd3fa3f6a6\nparent c3e6722b1b988cf8e1841bbdf35086e5b508123a\nauthor Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt> 1780046639 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780046639 +0200\n\nWire in OCM (#641)\n\n* Wire in ocm\n\nSigned-off-by: Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt>\n\n* fix(deps): bump multicluster-provider for client-go v0.36 compat\n\nmulticluster-provider v0.7.1 and its transitive apimachinery/v2 v2.31.x\npredate the cache.Informer/Controller interface change that added\nHasSyncedChecker and the new PopBatch signature in client-go v0.36,\nwhich is what the kubernetes monorepo update (#632) pulled in. Bumping\nmulticluster-provider to its main pseudo-version brings in a newer\napimachinery and unbreaks the build.\n\nSigned-off-by: Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Mangirdas Judeikis <mangirdas@judeikis.lt>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqGVsvCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAA7IQAA22yXWVCb9VFkSVMS8YleaO\nb07W6vPw3am57SQIxWy5fhTQtXuwhCUJ0gW/xGag6+TJyKZiyzJHvQNfQ2VBIO9X\nNJwarQI8AvQkmB9g5HHN/7Y7BKH17cm4oqwX+JRhOAZd5XgYDuK8R2VOfo4SivLv\nlqO9tFx4+prLQ+lzqa4By2PKqjF/Swzmz6qD