Ricarte Rocamora"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-23T15:41:45Z","email":"carmeloricarterocamora@gmail.com","name":"Carmelo Ricarte Rocamora"},"message":"feat: initial dashboard microfrontend with React 19 use() hook\n\n- Dashboard microfrontend with internal routing (React Router 7)\n- React 19 use() hook for declarative data fetching with Suspense\n- Promise cache for stable promise references across re-renders\n- Skeleton loaders (TableSkeleton, CardSkeleton) for loading states\n- Pages: Overview, UserList, UserDetail, Settings\n- Two export modes: standalone (with BrowserRouter) and shell integration\n- DashboardAppForShell uses window globals for dependency sharing\n- Server with redirect from / to /dashboard for standalone mode\n- Unit tests with Bun test + Testing Library + happy-dom\n- Absolute routing within basename for consistent behavior","tree":{"sha":"373ff8445de30534bf7ed67397a53d45571b539c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CarmeloRicarte/bun-react-dashboard/git/trees/373ff8445de30534bf7ed67397a53d45571b539c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CarmeloRicarte/bun-react-dashboard/git/commits/1e0cf14b0dfdf3c06e1d9a3daf89b2d7189a81a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10992042?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarmeloRicarte/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarmeloRicarte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarmeloRicarte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarmeloRicarte/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CarmeloRicarte","id":10992042,"login":"CarmeloRicarte","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwOTkyMDQy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarmeloRicarte/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CarmeloRicarte/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github