OS/commits/0d477f89b0b3955bd15f9d683f63b09152af4894"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trancendos/infinity-adminOS/commits/9aa139d61b255ab154c858a107e79dec79b6fabe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-27T01:55:36Z","email":"root@172.20.53.49","name":"root"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-27T01:55:36Z","email":"root@172.20.53.49","name":"root"},"message":"feat: Merge Phase 9-12 Infinity OS Implementation\n\nPhase 9: Complete Shell Views\n- Added 12 new views for comprehensive OS functionality:\n  * AIBuilder.tsx - Custom AI creation with 5 pre-built AIs, 9 models, 8 plugins\n  * AgentFactory.tsx - Agent management with creation, configuration, monitoring\n  * CICDOverview.tsx - CI/CD pipeline dashboard with deployment tracking\n  * DatabaseConsole.tsx - Database query interface with query history\n  * FileManager.tsx - File browser with operations and preview\n  * FinOpsDashboard.tsx - Cloud cost monitoring and optimization\n  * GitHub.tsx - Multi-provider Git hub (GitHub, GitLab, BitBucket)\n  * IntegrationsHub.tsx - 12 integrations with OAuth2 PKCE flow\n  * Marketplace.tsx - App and agent marketplace\n  * ObservabilityDashboard.tsx - System metrics and monitoring\n  * Settings.tsx - System configuration and preferences\n  * Terminal.tsx - Command-line interface with commands\n\n- Updated App.tsx with 17 routes (3 public, 14 protected)\n- Enhanced UI components (Taskbar, WindowManager, Desktop, etc.)\n- Updated ThemeProvider with dark/light mode support\n\nPhase 10: Testing Framework\n- Added comprehensive test suite:\n  * Unit tests (kernel.test.ts, self-healing.test.ts) - 70+ tests\n  * Integration tests (workers.test.ts) - 25+ tests with mock D1/KV/R2\n  * E2E tests (auth-flow.test.ts) - 35+ tests for auth lifecycle\n  * Chaos tests (resilience.test.ts) - 25+ tests for failure scenarios\n- Added vitest.config.ts with coverage thresholds (80% statements, 75% branches)\n\nPhase 11: Type Definitions & Configuration\n- Added 200+ new type definitions to packages/types/src/index.ts:\n  * IntegrationManifest, SandboxConfig\n  * GitConnection, Repository, Commit, PR, Issue, Pipeline\n  * AIModel, Plugin, CustomAI, Function\n  * CVEResult, DependencyEntry, SBOMEntry, HealthCheck, CircuitBreakerState\n  * Agent, FreeTierService, FinOpsReport\n  * CLICommand, CLIOption\n- Updated root package.json with 25+ npm scripts\n- Updated tsconfig.json with path aliases\n\nPhase 12: Production Hardening\n- Added DEPLOYMENT_CHECKLIST.md with 6 sections:\n  * Pre-Deployment, Infrastructure, Application\n  * Compliance (ISO 27001, GDPR, SOC 2, WCAG 2.2 AA)\n  * Zero-Cost verification, Post-Deployment\n- 100+ verification items covering build, test, security\n\nBuild Status:\n- All 56 turbo build tasks successful\n- Shell app builds successfully with all 12 views\n- 212/216 tests passing (4 pre-existing failures unrelated to this merge)\n\nTechnical Notes:\n- Maintained compatibility with existing AuthProvider IAM support\n- Preserved existing LockScreen and RoleSelector functionality\n- All views follow consistent design patterns and accessibility standards","tree":{"sha":"db7d25086e373138d6d9e42bc750d76e83ca36c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trancendos/infinity-adminOS/git/trees/db7d25086e373138d6d9e42bc750d76e83ca36c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trancendos/infinity-adminOS/git/commits/9aa139d61b255ab154c858a107e79dec79b6fabe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Trancendos/infinity-adminOS/commit/9aa139d61b255ab154c858a107e79dec79b6fabe","node_id":"C_kwDOQ_9STtoAKDlhYTEzOWQ2MWIyNTVhYjE1NGM4NThhMTA3ZTc5ZGVjNzliNmZhYmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Trancendos/infinity-adminOS/commit/88acf0123dd188b1eec49d86bc2c2341b9b44647","sha":"88acf0123dd188b1eec49d86bc2c2341b9b44647","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trancendos/infinity-adminOS/commits/88acf0