ain/header/path),\n  JWT auth, per-plan rate limiting (KV), dynamic CORS, route resolution via TenantDO,\n  Workers for Platforms dispatch\n\nPhase 2: Ports & Adapters (Hexagonal Architecture)\n- packages/adapters: Zero vendor lock-in abstraction layer\n  - Ports: StoragePort, AICompletionPort, VectorPort, DatabasePort\n  - Cloudflare adapters: D1, R2, Workers AI, Vectorize\n  - Fallback adapters: MemoryStorage, MemoryDatabase (testing/dev)\n  - AdaptiveService: Auto-failover across adapter implementations\n\nPhase 3: AI Gateway & Intelligence Layer\n- packages/ai-gateway: Per-tenant conditional AI routing\n  - Providers: Workers AI, OpenAI (GPT-4o), Anthropic (Claude)\n  - Features: priority-based failover, token budgets, response caching,\n    condition-based routing (plan/tags/schedule), latency timeouts, metrics\n\nBuild: 40/40 tasks GREEN (was 36)\nTests: 45/45 tasks GREEN (was 40)\n  - tenant-do: 16 tests\n  - dispatch: 32 tests\n  - adapters: 29 tests\n  - ai-gateway: 19 tests","tree":{"sha":"91920722508fd20dc9754d36f37068e100b86e24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trancendos/infinity-adminOS/git/trees/91920722508fd20dc9754d36f37068e100b86e24"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trancendos/infinity-adminOS/git/commits/4fbed974fb45f47e607608fb3984c5f4b867f1ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Trancendos/infinity-adminOS/commit/4fbed974fb45f47e607608fb3984c5f4b867f1ff","node_id":"C_kwDOQ_9STtoAKDRmYmVkOTc0ZmI0NWY0N2U2MDc2MDhmYjM5ODRjNWY0Yjg2N2YxZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Trancendos/infinity-adminOS/commit/ac72916895016d6938ec68f07577c6e1f0876949","sha":"ac72916895016d6938ec68f07577c6e1f0876949","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trancendos/infinity-adminOS/commits/ac72916895016d6938ec68f07577c6e1f0876949"}],"sha":"4fbed974fb45f47e607608fb3984c5f4b867f1ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trancendos/infinity-adminOS/commits/4fbed974fb45f47e607608fb3984c5f4b867f1ff"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trancendos/infinity-adminOS/commits/ac72916895016d6938ec68f07577c6e1f0876949/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-18T12:50:20Z","email":"townhall@trancendos.com","name":"Trancendos TownHall"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-18T12:50:20Z","email":"townhall@trancendos.com","name":"Trancendos TownHall"},"message":"fix(testing): resolve all 40/40 test task failures\n\n- Add vitest to root devDependencies for workspace-level test execution\n- Fix jest --passWithNoTests for packages without test files (lighthouse, hive, etc.)\n- Fix agent-sdk and void package test scripts (broken ts-jest/missing jest)\n- Fix shell app vitest configuration\n- Fix JSON parsing errors in error response tests (non-JSON 404 responses)\n- Fix auth-middleware workers (void, covert-synthesis) returning 401 not 404\n- Fix /status endpoint tests for workers without that route (cornelius, cyber-physical-api)\n- Fix identity worker health test (nested response structure)\n- All 40/40 turbo test tasks now pass\n- All 36/36 turbo build tasks still green","tree":{"sha":"065dddef43104519a958a94f9724798b8243b44d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trancendos/infinity-adminOS/git/trees/065dddef43104519a958a94f9724798b8243b44d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trancendos/infinity-adminOS/git/commits/ac72916895016d6938ec68f07577c6e1f0876949","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Trancendos/infinity-adminOS/commit/ac72916895016d6938ec68f07577c6e1f0876949","node_id":"C_kwDOQ_9STtoAKGFjNzI5MTY4OTUwMTZkNjkzOGVjNjhmMDc1NzdjNmUxZjA4NzY5NDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Trancendos/infinity-adminOS/commit/ffbb2e32b9294fdbf83e41a7d67bf83a8ec8630c","sha":"ffbb2e32b9294fdbf83e41a7d67bf83a8ec8630c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trancendos/infinit