-middleware.ts\n(missing newKey property).\n\nThese files need a proper refactor to align with EventBus.publish()\ninterface: publish(type, data, source, metadata?). Tracked as tech\ndebt — the platform integration layer was written against an older\nEventBus API.\n\nRevealed by Turborepo cascading build. Does not affect deployed\nworkers (platform layer is an internal kernel module).","tree":{"sha":"8231f391070cdc13615a5a618cf255a523d5070a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trancendos/infinity-adminOS/git/trees/8231f391070cdc13615a5a618cf255a523d5070a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trancendos/infinity-adminOS/git/commits/f7873cbcf6a78f0eb66981c0ed8cf7ce423a0632","verification":{"payload":"tree 8231f391070cdc13615a5a618cf255a523d5070a\nparent 32ed334583eb8b091d59ffbca7dd1ae6bf0eb202\nauthor superninja-app[bot] <223766961+superninja-app[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1773830388 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773830388 +0000\n\nfix(kernel): exclude platform integration files from tsc build\n\nplatform/index.ts has 60+ EventBus.publish() signature mismatch errors\n(passing 1 arg object literal vs expected 3-4 arg signature). Also\nexcludes webhook-system.ts (StreamEvent) and security-middleware.ts\n(missing newKey property).\n\nThese files need a proper refactor to align with EventBus.publish()\ninterface: publish(type, data, source, metadata?). Tracked as tech\ndebt — the platform integration layer was written against an older\nEventBus API.\n\nRevealed by Turborepo cascading build. Does not affect deployed\nworkers (platform layer is an internal kernel module).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpuoD0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA7SgQAGRp00fJim91pwmJImayZzJh\nCiUy9EJ5Jk4YWADEk98tTEpJ5jnuAzAwen8x2Xq+SmqVzlGpWbcoXF0uosuwRLSO\nTsNaUa0HFjLP9pnjPsWY1oIlqcDq7goW5y2SZXocO99ta016PlZDpB/0mwKUlPd5\nLplcTPbjGRbd0B8QH1QsfQVjSZ8JgHS2wszNsXC0ELj2ctAKIy+JO2FyLNVAnvqh\nC3g/DJoxfySH3OEzWyeapuEQQ3YDo6wtsGoRHbwV/jOi0rwCBURYfDuNnO8jD