r":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20074937?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eustatos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eustatos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eustatos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eustatos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eustatos","id":20074937,"login":"eustatos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMDc0OTM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eustatos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eustatos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eustatos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eustatos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eustatos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eustatos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eustatos/nexus-state/commits/e3f4fe9764865ee29f4a999ce7031518b1f47b78/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-26T15:26:21Z","email":"astashkinav@gmail.com","name":"eustatos"},"comment_count":1,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-26T15:26:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(core): defer atom registration until first store access\n\n- Remove immediate registration of named atoms in atom() function\n- Atoms are now registered only when accessed via store.get(), store.set(), or store.subscribe()\n- This ensures atoms are registered in the correct registry (global or isolated per-store)\n- Enables proper SSR isolation without global registry contamination\n- Aligns with native signal approach (no global state)\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: Named atoms are no longer registered immediately on creation.\nRegistration happens on first store access. Code that relies on immediate\nregistration (e.g., checking atomRegistry.isRegistered() before store access)\nneeds to be updated.","tree":{"sha":"6d51e701d0728cfb8b0b2a276664906c37ad1035","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eustatos/nexus-state/git/trees/6d51e701d0728cfb8b0b2a276664906c37ad1035"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eustatos/nexus-state/git/commits/e3f4fe9764865ee29f4a999ce7031518b1f47b78","verification":{"payload":"tree 6d51e701d0728cfb8b0b2a276664906c37ad1035\nparent fa408fb784334555389b1fae7a2fe4961b7dab49\nauthor eustatos <astashkinav@gmail.com> 1774538781 +0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774538781 +0400\n\nfeat(core): defer atom registration until first store access\n\n- Remove immediate registration of named atoms in atom() function\n- Atoms are now registered only when accessed via store.get(), store.set(), or store.subscribe()\n- This ensures atoms are registered in the correct registry (global or isolated per-store)\n- Enables proper SSR isolation without global registry contamination\n- Aligns with native signal approach (no global state)\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: Named atoms are no longer registered immediately on creation.\nRegistration happens on first store access. Code that relies on immediate\nregistration (e.g., checking atomRegistry.isRegistered() before store access)\nneeds to be updated.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpxVAdCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAMEgQAGKeVUcb3/5xwRvxjJnHkR5L\nvxVupRw8l7q1ZVfU3qywu0WyKZVBgP2yQ5u6yP8VnN/mE6imnqu8WDiuV5DbgRS3\n+Eir3TtLUaxvNzV2+9aY5C6tHGeayLX58QFjp7a59xkMAk28+Tt2qAQVHOzLGDMh\noq25gr+8d/sirK9i38muLGkBmKK0mXiW57iAisOxWzC5gQ9Mo9Xj6qzCJ4iN7t5y\nCQcy11GUTUFPb+2mAm2u0twyotT9PcLJeweIsiypcZV3FJY9owO5im6BmpG5FefC\nw5JNGRW8m5xanQLKvKXwdG5smMdwixn5etHGfT89X1Jxvyh2yOFnkLTHfBMG8W2c\ntDA7zoTjBIR51K2lTdTdqxd1mnUJUeeVmoc2QVX7CDDgpDp/bYwC3rWq4+w+8W9e\neHBFAUdgis3AkLD+W6AS+QMhz9Vs/eLpGGaS0HJbi9ImBfomUUJMb5tk35kUNGk8\nXBdKb2oaHi0uS22QSuboJPEryKPK1V5K94HGHUBYWd3aMX1Gq9q0kZ7WR389hQfX\nyHiH1LQNSrJ8vcuGTMk/x+8ssAOuelT1pTQeBmqH7aErPo05fZZM/AKT9WKyqDQg\nVdALZs4JnwyJR3+UgWZTD69oMRmLDe8H6nEcy/lleZQDD3wBfoBN1GUEvklp8waK\nxsy