e":"2026-09-27T10:12:12Z","email":"auke.v.o@hotmail.com","name":"Aukevanoost"},"message":"feat: pass define, target, sourcemap and preserveSymlinks through to esbuild\n\nEsBuildAdapterConfig gains `define`, `target`, `sourcemap` and\n`preserveSymlinks`. Exposes and shared mappings get all four. Shared npm\npackages get `target` and `sourcemap` but not `define` or\n`preserveSymlinks`: core''s externals cache key can''t see adapter options\n(native-federation-core#152), so changing `target` or `sourcemap` needs a\ncleared cache until that lands. Defaults are unchanged: `target` esnext\nfor source, `sourcemap` follows `dev`.\n\nThe shared-mappings plugin now realpaths the directories of both the\nimport target and the importer, so a relative import that walks through\na symlinked dir into a mapped lib is still rewritten to the mapping\nspecifier, while imports inside a lib reached through a symlink stay\ninternal.","tree":{"sha":"bbef2cc9da26e8f3116103ec9ed15151bd674595","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/esbuild-adapter/git/trees/bbef2cc9da26e8f3116103ec9ed15151bd674595"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-federation/esbuild-adapter/git/commits/8a0be0870227488d6c0d3f6e98e1c6c0f86f4683","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11028826?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Aukevanoost","id":11028826,"login":"Aukevanoost","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDI4ODI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Aukevanoost/received_events","repos_ur