3691882a4e60/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T09:34:44Z","email":"fermionmx@gmail.com","name":"KBH-js"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T09:34:44Z","email":"fermionmx@gmail.com","name":"KBH-js"},"message":"feat(calculator): 키패드 간격 수정 + Liquid Glass 재질 적용\n\n- 간격 버그: flex-1 그리드 + h-14 고정 버튼 조합으로 남는 높이가 행 사이\n  공백으로 벌어지던 것을 grid-rows-5 + 트랙 채움으로 수정 — 키가 창 크기에\n  맞게 스케일되고 간격은 gap-2로 균일\n- Liquid Glass: 호스트의 ''@proto/shared/glass'' MF 싱글턴 계약을 미러링\n  (workspace 의존성 + shared 설정 + raw .tsx transpile include). 임베드 시\n  호스트 인스턴스 소비, standalone은 번들 폴백(glass.css 리터럴 fallback)\n- 디스플레이는 글라스 카드, 19개 키 전부 글라스 버튼. 색상은 고정 다크 글라스\n  정체성으로 theme.js의 glassTint 토큰에서만 (raw-color lint 준수)\n- theme.d.ts 추가 — shared 패키지 선례를 따른 로컬 토큰 타입 선언\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8517b6dec1f7fb531cd07fd7e2468d89f9c58722","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/trees/8517b6dec1f7fb531cd07fd7e2468d89f9c58722"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/commits/92b96b2ac5d63d4a00651ac5b5473691882a4e60","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74466125?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KBH-js","id":74466125,"login":"KBH-js","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NDY2MTI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/