 배포 커밋 SHA에 붙어 Preview 결과가 PR에 표시됨\n- 기존 test:e2e에서 e2e/deploy 제외(testIgnore), TESTING.md/AGENTS.md 문서화\n  (TESTING.md: 삭제된 useShortcuts 스위트 행도 정리)\n\n검증: SMOKE_URL=https://proto-six-iota.vercel.app pnpm test:smoke → 2 passed\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"be0efdd76bbf8bef4d320f5d6be3ed8e14b57a78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/trees/be0efdd76bbf8bef4d320f5d6be3ed8e14b57a78"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/commits/dae104c690d9a709adabaa28eb7c091dfdd84b5a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74466125?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KBH-js","id":74466125,"login":"KBH-js","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NDY2MTI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/KBH-js/proto/commit/dae104c690d9a709adabaa28eb7c091dfdd84b5a","node_id":"C_kwDORAQN1NoAKGRhZTEwNGM2OTBkOWE3MDlhZGFiYWEyOGViN2MwOTFkZmRkODRiNWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KBH-js/proto/commit/3ec78e77a8b41f7f97730db0293ba1d9c7e84b0c","sha":"3ec78e77a8b41f7f97730db0293ba1d9c7e84b0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/commits/3ec78e77a8b41f7f97730db0293ba1d9c7e84b0