om/users/KBH-js/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/commits/dce976ce297a8e3562c79d7e4d69ff5da1e564a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T06:54:00Z","email":"fermionmx@gmail.com","name":"KBH-js"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T06:54:00Z","email":"fermionmx@gmail.com","name":"KBH-js"},"message":"chore(vrt): retire page-level VRT from CI — keep as a design note\n\n페이지/창 단위 스크린샷은 VRT의 잘못된 granularity라는 결론: 캡처 표면 안의\n카피 한 줄만 바뀌어도 baseline이 무효화돼, 콘텐츠 PR마다 ubuntu baseline\n재렌더 왕복을 치르면서 E2E 단언이 못 잡는 것은 거의 잡지 못했다.\n\n- e2e/vrt/(spec + baseline 6장), vrt-baseline.yml 워크플로 삭제\n- ci.yml vrt job 제거 — verify/e2e 2개 job으로\n- package.json test:vrt(:update) 스크립트, playwright vrt project 제거\n- TESTING.md VRT 섹션을 설계 노트로 재작성(접근법·톨러런스 실측 교훈은\n  회고로 보존, story 단위가 올바른 단위임을 명시)\n- About theming 카피(ko/en)의 \"VRT가 CI에서 돌아갑니다\" 문장을 실제 사실\n  (raw 컬러·px lint 가드레일)로 교체 — 은퇴 후 거짓 주장이 되므로\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"48d7f1b2000069607d73d6729d71467f16f86964","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/trees/48d7f1b2000069607d73d6729d71467f16f86964"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/commits/dce976ce297a8e3562c79d7e4d69ff5da1e564a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74466125?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH