ate, maxDiffPixelRatio 0.02,\n  animations disabled); `chromium` project now ignores vrt/**\n- package.json: test:vrt / test:vrt:update; test:e2e pinned to the\n  chromium project\n- CI: `vrt` job compares against committed ubuntu baselines and skips\n  with a notice until they exist; new manual \"VRT baseline\" workflow\n  renders on ubuntu and commits baselines back to the branch\n- About app: theming claim partial -> live, ko/en desc now states the\n  VRT matrix runs in CI (was \"planned\")\n- TESTING.md: VRT layer, baseline procedure, CI job docs\n\nVerified locally: first run writes 6 snapshots, second run passes 6/6;\nfunctional e2e 8/8; lint/typecheck/test/build green. Local Windows\nrenders were deleted — baselines must come from the VRT baseline\nworkflow (ubuntu).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9841f0e95be08a65eaaca56ac24ab6ee0ac10de6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/trees/9841f0e95be08a65eaaca56ac24ab6ee0ac10de6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/commits/08a674e9a5090ab09d459dd8f6d4cae74efceadc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74466125?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KBH-js","id":74466125,"login":"KBH-js","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NDY2MTI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"ht