targets\n\nTour flow (first-run + replay):\n- Copy no longer invites clicks the overlay blocks; last step spotlights the\n  About icon and ''Get started'' opens About (Escape/Skip still just dismiss)\n- Hide Skip on the last step, add ArrowLeft/Right step navigation\n- minimizeAll() on tour start so persisted windows can''t cover anchors\n- Detect browser language on first visit (persisted choice always wins)\n\nAbout as the funnel endpoint:\n- GitHub / LinkedIn / copy-email actions in the header (useCopyEmail hook\n  shared with StartMenu)\n- Deployment list derived from the app registry (RemoteRef.prodEntry) so all\n  four remotes appear and the list can never go stale; config keeps host only\n\nMobile & UI:\n- Traffic-light hit pads widened to ~28x28px (::after ±8px + gap-4 pitch),\n  titlebar spacers rebalanced\n- Icon rail becomes a 2-column grid below sm so all 8 icons fit short screens\n- remote-compute gains container queries (stacked master-detail, @2xl KPI\n  row); both dashboards get a ''Demo seed data'' badge and icon-only toolbar\n  buttons in narrow windows\n\ni18n:\n- resolveJosa() post-pass picks 을/를·이/가·은/는·과/와 after interpolation\n  (Hangul-final aware; non-Hangul keeps the hedged pair)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fdc25246989202937723f8807a365574e14c837c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/trees/fdc25246989202937723f8807a365574e14c837c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/commits/27f9f7eef6ee5835765b6c315781b0b4fb8d5f46","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74466125?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/gists{/gis