 gate, Playwright E2E, AGENTS.md, About claims expansion\n\n- ci: GitHub Actions PR gate (.github/workflows/ci.yml) — quality(lint/vitest/host build),\n  build-remotes 4-package matrix, e2e job with report artifact; root packageManager pinned\n- e2e: Playwright suite (8 specs) — boot/tour, local window lifecycle, MF remote load,\n  window ops, failure-injection -> per-frame recovery, theme/locale toggles.\n  webServer array boots host dev + 4 remote dev servers (dev mode = devEntryUrl path)\n- docs: AGENTS.md cross-cutting conventions (linked from CLAUDE.md), TESTING.md rewrite,\n  README CI badge + stack update\n- about: claims table 5 -> 10 rows (open/link actions, planned tag for out-of-scope perf),\n  React Compiler/useWatch decision card, network/compute deploy links, ko/en locales\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e9884a46d43f3582384f4bf8d77c99262a249a1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/trees/e9884a46d43f3582384f4bf8d77c99262a249a1d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/commits/6b35e7348ad190b5a11ba2e4b30a64d39bef8c5e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74466125?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KBH-js","id":74466125,"login":"KBH-js","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NDY2MTI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscript