BH-js","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NDY2MTI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/commits/5cdbe3d22d28ce426a5d3f4674c781c1d6654b8d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T04:41:27Z","email":"fermionmx@gmail.com","name":"KBH-js"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T04:41:27Z","email":"fermionmx@gmail.com","name":"KBH-js"},"message":"feat(harness): CI gate, typecheck script, manifest/lint-rule tests, edit-time lint hook\n\n- GitHub Actions CI (.github/workflows/ci.yml): frozen-lockfile install,\n  lint, typecheck, test, host + all-remote builds on PR and main pushes\n- Root packageManager/engines pins (pnpm@10.10.0, node>=20) so\n  pnpm/action-setup and corepack resolve the same toolchain as the remotes\n- \"typecheck\" scripts: tsc -b per remote + root aggregate (pnpm -r skips\n  no-script @proto/shared)\n- Fix latent break: remote-{calculator,notes,network} tsconfigs now exclude\n  test files like remote-compute already did — remote-network''s isolated\n  tsc -b failed on vitest/host-path imports (Vercel deploy + CI blocker)\n- manifestFile.test.ts: shipped public/remotes.manifest.json runs through\n  the production fetchAppCatalog validator via MSW, plus id/name/port\n  uniqueness checks\n- RuleTester suites for local/no-raw-colors and local/no-raw-px; vitest\n  include widened (eslint-rules/*.test.js, packages .test.tsx)\n- Claude harness: PostToolUse hook lints edited .ts/.tsx at edit time\n  (.claude/hooks/lint-changed.mjs), pnpm test/typecheck permission allows,\n  project verify skill