ned at its own registry-defined size (560-760px, all\ndifferent). Windows now share one computed default: 78% of the width\nleft of the app-launcher rail (capped at 1080px for ultrawides) by 80%\nof the work-area height, centered in the region right of the rail so a\nfresh window never covers the launcher; the cascade only pushes\ndown-right from there and the work-area math keeps it above the\ntaskbar. getAppDefaultSize and its store wiring are removed (manifest\ndefaultSize fields remain but are no longer consulted). Verified live:\nfour apps incl. a remote all open 811x683 at 1180x918, x>=246 (rail\nends at 108), deepest cascade bottom 840 <= taskbar top 854.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7f4b2ad85b0a2a41e404c78e7fb4d1f55e608f61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/trees/7f4b2ad85b0a2a41e404c78e7fb4d1f55e608f61"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/commits/7190bc964d970b87a83972a7a19050bb835e0f4f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74466125?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KBH-js","id":74466125,"login":"KBH-js","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NDY2MTI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js","user_v