roto/commits/1162c547e14cc679059299d259e16fcad5904542/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T13:10:25Z","email":"fermionmx@gmail.com","name":"KBH-js"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T13:10:25Z","email":"fermionmx@gmail.com","name":"KBH-js"},"message":"feat: minimize/restore animates to/from the taskbar item\n\nMinimize was a fixed shrink-24px-down (nowhere near the taskbar item)\nand restore just popped with the generic open animation. Replace the\nsetTimeout-then-commit flow with store-derived phases\n(idle/minimizing/restoring, adjust-state-during-render), so taskbar-\nclick minimize animates too. On each transition a layout effect\nmeasures the frame and its data-window-id taskbar item and feeds the\noffset/scale to the keyframes as CSS variables; restore plays the\nreverse from the same target. A one-shot hasRestored flag stops the\nmount open-animation from replaying after a restore, and\nprefers-reduced-motion collapses all window animations to 1ms.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4346d4934c1856cbfbc9943d4bc639fdf5e75c00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/trees/4346d4934c1856cbfbc9943d4bc639fdf5e75c00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/commits/1162c547e14cc679059299d259e16fcad5904542","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74466125?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KBH-js","id":74466125,"login":"KBH-js","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NDY2MTI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.g