5T13:05:00Z","email":"fermionmx@gmail.com","name":"KBH-js"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T13:05:00Z","email":"fermionmx@gmail.com","name":"KBH-js"},"message":"fix: locale-reactive, dark-mode error fallback\n\nThe error card was rendered from the class component with\ntranslateNow(), which snapshots the locale -- toggling language while\nthe card was visible left stale copy. Extract the fallback into a\nfunctional ErrorFallback using the reactive useTranslation() hook, and\npair every light-only class with a dark: variant (the card renders\nunder the shell root, so no extra theme scoping is needed). Verified\nlive: Break -> dark card -> locale toggle re-renders copy -> Try Again\nstill recovers the window.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d5b66ba541f2b42979d8f1dda9c2916da18ea9aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/trees/d5b66ba541f2b42979d8f1dda9c2916da18ea9aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/commits/3b410d3d6a608f0f796ec8083d0122d20ac4a0cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74466125?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KBH-js","id":74466125,"login":"KBH-js","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NDY2MTI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/subscriptions","