er-detail area was a fixed two-column grid, so both tables got\ncrushed side-by-side in a small window. Base layout is now stacked\n(two rows, each with its own internal scroll) and switches to the\nside-by-side layout from @2xl (672px of app width). Verified embedded\n(1180px window: 2 cols; 452px: stacked) and standalone.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5ebc415c02b11c9a333a25a513a6fd46e985afd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/trees/5ebc415c02b11c9a333a25a513a6fd46e985afd8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/commits/2d24dc60776556da1e8593c373ef356cc94c7286","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74466125?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KBH-js","id":74466125,"login":"KBH-js","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NDY2MTI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/KBH-js/proto/commit/2d24dc60776556da1e8593c373ef356cc94c7286","node_id":"C_kwDORAQN1NoAKDJkMjRkYzYwNzc2NTU2ZGExZTg1OTNjMzczZWYzNTZjYzk0YzcyODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KBH-js/proto/commit/15a7de8098748f1aa87cbb4d0884c93d58fb3e30","sha":"15a7de8098748f1aa87cbb4d0884c93d58fb3e30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/commits/15a7de8098748f1aa87cbb4d0884c93d58fb3e30"}],"sha":"2d24dc60776556da1e8593c373ef356cc94c7286","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/commits/2d24dc60776556da1e8593c373ef356cc94c7286"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74466125?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KBH-js","id":74466125,"login":"KBH-js","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NDY2MTI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/commits/15a7de8098748f1aa87cbb4d0884c93d58fb3e30/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T12:54:49Z","email":"fermionmx@gmail.com","name":"KBH-js"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T12:54:49Z","email":"fermionmx@gmail.com","name":"KBH-js"},"message":"feat: container-query responsive app layouts (host + remote-network)\n\nTailwind sm: breakpoints keyed off the VIEWPORT, so a small floating\nwindow on a large monitor still got the wide layout (5-column KPI row\ncrammed into a 400px window). Add @tailwindcss/container-queries to the\nhost and remote-network (own devDep -- the remote deploys\nindependently), mark the WindowFrame content area and the NetworkApp\nroot as @container, and convert the window-internal breakpoints:\nAboutApp/DesignTokensApp grids sm: -> @lg:, network SummaryCards\nsm:grid-cols-5 -> @2xl:grid-cols-5. Verified live: About grid flips\n2-col/1-col at 512px of WINDOW width regardless of viewport.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"78f783e9f69be5e62a056bdb46817ed2b4a75233","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/trees/78f783e9f69be5e62a056bdb46817ed2b4a75233"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/commits/15a7de8098748f1aa87cbb4d0884c93d58fb3e30","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74466125?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KBH-js","id":74466125,"login":"KBH-js","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NDY2MTI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/KBH-js/proto/commit/15a7de8098748f1aa87cbb4d0884c93d58fb3e30","node_id":"C_kwDORAQN1NoAKDE1YTdkZTgwOTg3NDhmMWFhODdjYmI0ZDA4ODRjOTNkNThmYjNlMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KBH-js/proto/commit/62da16fc717855a1539384ad6753930be3c1dafb","sha":"62da16fc717855a1539384ad6753930be3c1dafb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/commits/62da16fc717855a1539384ad6753930be3c1dafb"}],"sha":"15a7de8098748f1aa87cbb4d0884c93d58fb3e30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/commits/15a7de8098748f1aa87cbb4d0884c93d58fb3e30"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74466125?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KBH-js","id":74466125,"login":"KBH-js","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NDY2MTI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/commits/62da16fc717855a1539384ad6753930be3c1dafb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T12:49:24Z","email":"fermionmx@gmail.com","name":"KBH-js"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T12:49:24Z","email":"fermionmx@gmail.com","name":"KBH-js"},"message":"fix: enlarge traffic-light hit targets (visuals unchanged)\n\nThe Aqua traffic lights are 13px dots and the button was exactly the\ndot, making close/min/max hard to hit. Add an invisible ::after pad\n(+-4px horizontal so adjacent 21px-pitch zones meet without\noverlapping, +-6px vertical) -- pseudo-elements hit-test as part of the\nbutton, so clicks and the cluster-hover glyphs both keep working.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7318be2ef204010f1a81f97c1c7575359782277f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/trees/7318be2ef204010f1a81f97c1c7575359782277f"},"url":"https://a