r_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KBH-js","id":74466125,"login":"KBH-js","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NDY2MTI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/commits/471f41e780bdd5fa46d59a413eb0d238e62d2ec3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T12:36:16Z","email":"fermionmx@gmail.com","name":"KBH-js"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T12:36:16Z","email":"fermionmx@gmail.com","name":"KBH-js"},"message":"a11y: menu roles + roving focus for start/context menus; dialog semantics + focus trap for tour\n\nNew useMenuFocus hook (layout effect so unmount focus-restore runs\nbefore React detaches the menu DOM): focuses the first menuitem on\nopen, roves with ArrowUp/Down + Home/End, closes on Escape/Tab, and\nrestores focus only when it is still inside the menu so outside-clicks\nkeep their own target.\n\n- StartMenu: role=menu + labeled, items role=menuitem tabIndex=-1;\n  start button gets aria-haspopup/aria-expanded.\n- DesktopContextMenu: same roles + hook; its own Escape branch moved\n  into the hook.\n- FirstRunTour: role=dialog aria-modal with aria-labelledby/\n  describedby, primary button focused per step, Tab wraps across the\n  card buttons, and focus returns to the pre-tour element on finish.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"26abe6b47440d689bd68810f5c92f676e4c1efb2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/trees/26abe6b47440d689bd68810f5c92f676e4c1efb2"}