gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KBH-js","id":74466125,"login":"KBH-js","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NDY2MTI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/commits/f672cba3bd441b1d78b8fcced9f4f9e2cec68a16/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T12:33:05Z","email":"74466125+KBH-js@users.noreply.github.com","name":"KBH"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T12:33:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: land post-merge deploy fixes for remote-compute (follow-up to #13) (#14)\n\n* fix: exclude tests from remote-compute tsc build for isolated Vercel deploys\n\nThe Vercel project uploads only the package directory, so `tsc -b` cannot\nresolve vitest or the workspace-shared MSW server the test files import.\nTests remain covered by the root vitest run. remote-compute is now live at\nhttps://remote-compute.vercel.app (ASSET_PREFIX set), matching the manifest\nentryUrl.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: host-preview launch config for verifying prod entryUrl resolution\n\n`pnpm preview` serves the production host build, where isDevelopment is\nfalse and the catalog resolves each remote''s deployed entryUrl instead of\ndevEntryUrl — the only local way to exercise the Vercel MF chain.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"74cd475c03cef6807811f7f8554a2c1a43b75692","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/trees/74cd475c03cef6807811f7f8554a2c1a43b75692"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/commits/f672cba3bd441b1d78b8fcced9f4f9e2cec68a16","verification":{"payload":"tree 74cd475c03cef6807811f7f8554a2c1a43b75692\nparent ee57d2ff6ccd23e10525bfc640fa58ee5c6fd68e\nauthor KBH <74466125+KBH-js@users.noreply.github.com> 1784118785 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784118785 +0900\n\nfix: land post-merge deploy fixes for remote-compute (follow-up to #13) (#14)\n\n* fix: exclude tests from remote-compute tsc build for isolated Vercel deploys\n\nThe Vercel project uploads only the package directory, so `tsc -b` cannot\nresolve vitest or the workspace-shared MSW server the test files import.\nTests remain covered by the root vitest run. remote-compute is now live at\nhttps://remote-compute.vercel.app (ASSET_PREFIX set), matching the manifest\nentryUrl.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: host-preview launch config for verifying prod entryUrl resolution\n\n`pnpm preview` serves the production host build, where isDevelopment is\nfalse and the catalog resolves each remote''s deployed entryUrl instead of\ndevEntryUrl — the only local way to exercise the Vercel MF chain.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqV34BCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXnEQAAZilT7U4+JvwTOFp48O4UeO\nQNEUF/wL53hv7dNL9VMS9o94EarYs6xVxp01xB9BCXReXhZX4Zow6NzYRni7ijfo\nXskjTUVDoCzaYfmVpyaycCaHsF1dXPsbZp/AOl1enTNBv15FufW5nqPJAAAV2Sey\nBjEIT5++bAZRScxU2FubSfs4u/Ej0vwiHrjvTOgWK4GeRbGMjz2YDjiFr1HlFtb2\njaHglxzZSUl0yQOwmKjiv3AAgVJj94BApylagYE3Z2EpSWlMJ0f8qn1vaLmr1g2R\nYxDVWIPbOwikzyNtAYRnp2QlXPj3LgFKtbWZPsptWbNle5VHy7WNDbUs7RwMOLHR\nK18wvCLrmZBiCC++nJdCLRtyX2VR6ho425H3SgPHOQNryflYMFOyNpEj6Y22fKp4\nN3lXcbPNP6LiIuy6Ub94LjuZKhaBqu/DfQTZ7FJzQN4UxI82LQAfBrbbcOQF4