\ndocument.body with its own theme scope, clamp left to the viewport, cap\nheight to the space above the dock, and scroll the app/link sections.\nAlso close on Escape and window resize.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"da1332f0d1ca73b110e351b0a084a6da3eee9d0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/trees/da1332f0d1ca73b110e351b0a084a6da3eee9d0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/commits/4c165d5d9baa2fbc9bb456413d09e5da3cd6cc74","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74466125?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KBH-js","id":74466125,"login":"KBH-js","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NDY2MTI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/KBH-js/proto/commit/4c165d5d9baa2fbc9bb456413d09e5da3cd6cc74","node_id":"C_kwDORAQN1NoAKDRjMTY1ZDVkOWJhYTJmYmM5YmI0NTY0MTNkMDllNWRhM2NkNmNjNzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/KBH-js/proto/commit/3355aa916cbaa926553fb0d794f7239fdf26c6f7","sha":"3355aa916cbaa926553fb0d794f7239fdf26c6f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/commits/3355aa916cbaa926553fb0d794f7239fdf26c6f7"}],"sha":"4c165d5d9baa2fbc9bb456413d09e5da3cd6cc74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/commits/4c165d5d9baa2fbc9bb456413d09e5da3cd6cc74"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74466125?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KBH-js","id":74466125,"login":"KBH-js","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NDY2MTI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/commits/ee57d2ff6ccd23e10525bfc640fa58ee5c6fd68e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T12:15:57Z","email":"74466125+KBH-js@users.noreply.github.com","name":"KBH"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T12:15:57Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: OpenStack Nova compute dashboard remote (port 5004) (#13)\n\n* feat: OpenStack Nova compute dashboard remote (port 5004)\n\nNew packages/remote-compute mirroring remote-network''s architecture:\n- Nova Compute API v2.1 domain (servers, flavors, os-hypervisors,\n  os-volume_attachments) over an in-memory db with outage/latency injection\n- Isomorphic transport: /api/nova/* via MSW standalone, in-memory fallback\n  when embedded in the host; TanStack Query per-resource caching\n- Scoped .remote-compute CSS-variable tokens (violet accent) reacting to the\n  host .dark ancestor; remote-local ko/en i18n via the host locale bridge\n- Seed fixed IPs cross-match remote-network''s floating-IP mappings so both\n  OpenStack dashboards share one cluster narrative\n- Vitest suites: db selectors/referential integrity/health + MSW REST contract\n\nHost registration: remotes.manifest.json entry (no host code coupling),\n''server'' icon, app.compute locale keys, launch.json/docs updates.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: add-remote-app project skill, mandatory for new remote requests\n\nCaptures the full remote-scaffolding procedure validated while building\npackages/remote-compute: package scaffold invariants (async boundary,\nCSS self-import, scoped tokens, isomorphic MSW transport, deterministic\ndb, singleton sharing, port/CORS), host registration points (manifest,\nappIcons, locales, launch.json, docs), and the verification gates\n(install/test/lint/tsc/build + standalone & host-embedded browser checks).\n\nCLAUDE.md now instructs invoking this skill for any remote-app creation\nrequest, in any language/phrasing, before proceeding.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d18c8d6557fd48eed074dc9269e4affc2590bb16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/trees/d18c8d6557fd48eed074dc9269e4affc2590bb16"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/commits/ee57d2ff6ccd23e10525bfc640fa58ee5c6fd68e","verification":{"payload":"tree d18c8d6557fd48eed074dc9269e4affc2590bb16\nparent 3355aa916cbaa926553fb0d794f7239fdf26c6f7\nauthor KBH <74466125+KBH-js@users.noreply.github.com> 1784117757 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784117757 +0900\n\nfeat: OpenStack Nova compute dashboard remote (port 5004) (#13)\n\n* feat: OpenStack Nova compute dashboard remote (port 5004)\n\nNew packages/remote-compute mirroring remote-network''s architecture:\n- Nova Compute API v2.1 domain (servers, flavors, os-hypervisors,\n  os-volume_attachments) over an in-memory db with outage/latency injection\n- Isomorphic transport: /api/nova/* via MSW standalone, in-memory fallback\n  when embedded in the host; TanStack Query per-resource caching\n- Scoped .remote-compute CSS-variable tokens (violet accent) reacting to the\n  host .dark ancestor; remote-local ko/en i18n via the host locale bridge\n- Seed fixed IPs cross-match remote-network''s floating-IP mappings so both\n  OpenStack dashboards share one cluster narrative\n- Vitest suites: db selectors/referential integrity/health + MSW REST contract\n\nHost registration: remotes.manifest.json entry (no host code coupling),\n''server'' icon, app.compute locale keys, launch.json/docs updates.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: add-remote-app project skill, mandatory for new remote requests\n\nCaptures the full remote-scaffolding procedure validated while building\npackages/remote-compute: package scaffold invariants (async boundary,\nCSS self-import, scoped tokens, isomorphic MSW transport, deterministic\ndb, singleton sharing, port/CORS), host registration points (manifest,\nappIcons, locales, launch.json, docs), and the verification gates\n(install/test/lint/tsc/build + standalone & host-embedded browser checks).\n\nCLAUDE.md now instructs invoking this skill for any remote-app creation\nrequest, in any language/phrasing, before proceeding.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqV3n9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAfaUQACyrlEK42rMdnfPshJzWHUsR\nM7mY9I4snQYsrJCic1ldyFhfBO9gqedvspLgH+Jxdpar5+aWa1bCWtQ2hCvMcPfd\nHG90uYgL+Hm20bGIxJm2eUzMwnmjqKQRGYpWdOEQQcGl467q/q9Utu91WCQyiM+3\nN5QJijFYVlF4JMjyeexZXJFRFeYXo63Y4Rf85oCPDMSzN2r/+ashyMOIZ72JvNXH\nLDHi/svmXIoqeSRd6xmC2/SAoLS5SYr4E5j4Q2/9mwrlCIbw1kQc8mDnqx+I1A1T\nK+9skPbUIisF5Ea073GWyA39tRagmKdrP6pnY5fz0NjJ2JGT3c5aOYSNVNnqLHOx\nd5Kf