0393d736b9d36a046","sha":"f86e470d9875522f280fd970393d736b9d36a046","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/commits/f86e470d9875522f280fd970393d736b9d36a046"}],"sha":"3355aa916cbaa926553fb0d794f7239fdf26c6f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/commits/3355aa916cbaa926553fb0d794f7239fdf26c6f7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74466125?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KBH-js","id":74466125,"login":"KBH-js","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NDY2MTI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/commits/f86e470d9875522f280fd970393d736b9d36a046/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T12:45:38Z","email":"74466125+KBH-js@users.noreply.github.com","name":"KBH"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T12:45:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: reload persisted remote windows once the catalog resolves (#11)\n\nPersisted remote windows (calculator/notes) rehydrate from localStorage\nbefore the app catalog resolves, so WindowManagerLayout mounts their\nWindowFrames during boot while the registry is still ''loading''. With no\nregistry entry yet, `remote` is undefined and the lazy wrapper seeds to\nnull via useState — and never re-seeds once the catalog registers the\nremote, leaving the window stuck on the \"app not found\" fallback forever.\n\nAdd a one-shot useEffect that seeds a fresh lazy() wrapper the moment\n`remote` first becomes available. The `!remoteComponent` guard keeps it\nfrom firing when a wrapper already exists (normal mount or handleRetry),\nso it can''t clobber a live load. Kept in useState/useEffect (not useMemo)\nper the React Compiler discipline in CLAUDE.md.\n\nAdd the repo''s first component test (WindowFrame.test.tsx): it reproduces\nthe boot-time notFound bug and verifies the remote loads after the catalog\nresolves, plus a guard that the already-present path still works. Requires\n@testing-library/react and a vitest.config.ts tweak to include .test.tsx\nwith the automatic JSX runtime.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"966c0acff1b3863c1130a6fe8a2e9ae26c92fcb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/trees/966c0acff1b3863c1130a6fe8a2e9ae26c92fcb1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/commits/f86e470d9875522f280fd970393d736b9d36a046","verification":{"payload":"tree 966c0acff1b3863c1130a6fe8a2e9ae26c92fcb1\nparent e1f8ef31cd1f4b31ba4fc88403247286ece97ec1\nauthor KBH <74466125+KBH-js@users.noreply.github.com> 1783946738 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783946738 +0900\n\nfix: reload persisted remote windows once the catalog resolves (#11)\n\nPersisted remote windows (calculator/notes) rehydrate from localStorage\nbefore the app catalog resolves, so WindowManagerLayout mounts their\nWindowFrames during boot while the registry is still ''loading''. With no\nregistry entry yet, `remote` is undefined and the lazy wrapper seeds to\nnull via useState — and never re-seeds once the catalog registers the\nremote, leaving the window stuck on the \"app not found\" fallback forever.\n\nAdd a one-shot useEffect that seeds a fresh lazy() wrapper the moment\n`remote` first becomes available. The `!remoteComponent` guard keeps it\nfrom firing when a wrapper already exists (normal mount or handleRetry),\nso it can''t clobber a live load. Kept in useState/useEffect (not useMemo)\nper the React Compiler discipline in CLAUDE.md.\n\nAdd the repo''s first component test (WindowFrame.test.tsx): it reproduces\nthe boot-time notFound bug and verifies the remote loads after the catalog\nresolves, plus a guard that the already-present path still works. Requires\n@testing-library/react and a vitest.config.ts tweak to include .test.tsx\nwith the automatic JSX runtime.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqVN3yCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA0dkQAHN7sV8S4julCMwtHx/o+mWZ\nJLVNEdil133Q+839zDKCjJypUaXPebgOTAK/mY/yAfDaF0Hc5eMduaLGU/Y89HMD\nsxnx9VY6QoaFgMVgEuIjGxByLkbPi1cSJDNh0oCndr+IrXqjEFHNukG6zqSL9Q0q\nMEMqSmyI+XHM4z8yj2X/z6IcbvQMnayrar99NaQ6Cq2xbUgDpz9kfo/DUkySrbQP\nLBv9qPo9eAcJ/L2V8Xzk147xhSquP1Dj2a0fjuHjbTrdyNKNL5RwZ+vSgxaC/hQw\n23IIAdC6P1YjQneDiWa8znExPYekQXwCnEroPQxWDT5EcDdf2zvZHwpmYb0hbiQD\nr95wmsWEKDF752qOXjsoP2plQ8eYNJewZLpBhPQN6g4ofyrDSDV/4nat06cAQCvm\nzcNXSA+cOmISJY3lYizgwbLx7t/a8zyS6lQ4fuzAJvjvW1uzabp9KOX1eYsXOmuJ\nsx3+hZVAzt42J81dVPrRS0h0jHI5LLGDYt+L6GEygdBs8okj2EuPiQLFsjAKw7Rz\nAxdPfLGV8KbggveWkLO6fnBLfuxCQ6yo/UooOTzB+R23yy6o22KMTHcOoHZRW5O3\n+6VNBGRaxH15oVdlWm8s9ceuAqACHqC415XcWdurJBG+N31pMuwDauTa+lHI90zG\niPZSxKk5MFUiU8pXKQwl\n=otz1\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-13T12:45:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","