/KBH-js/proto/commits/e1f8ef31cd1f4b31ba4fc88403247286ece97ec1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T12:36:08Z","email":"74466125+KBH-js@users.noreply.github.com","name":"KBH"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T12:36:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: network dashboard remote (TanStack Query + MSW) + design-token guardrail (#9)\n\n* feat: network dashboard remote (TanStack Query + MSW) + design-token guardrail\n\nTier 2 — turn toy remotes into resume-evidence domain apps, consuming the\nTier 1 contracts (prefsStore / i18n / Federation Inspector) unchanged.\n\n⑤ packages/remote-network — OpenStack Neutron dashboard remote (:5003):\n  - TanStack Query: per-resource loading/error states, master-detail caching,\n    a \"Simulate outage\" toggle (resetQueries + retry:0) for error→recovery.\n  - MSW mock REST over one seeded db.ts: standalone browser worker (real\n    /api/neutron/*) with an in-memory fallback for host-embedded mode\n    (cross-origin service worker is impossible there).\n  - Host→remote bridge (src/federation/hostBridge.ts): locale via\n    host:locale-changed + useHostLocale; theme rides the shell .dark ancestor\n    through remote-scoped CSS-variable tokens.\n\n⑧ Design-token guardrail:\n  - eslint-rules/no-raw-colors.js (local/no-raw-colors) blocks raw hex/rgb/hsl\n    in .ts/.tsx; Desktop wallpaper moved into @proto/shared/theme, SnapPreview\n    rgba -> ring token, toastStore console art excepted.\n  - Design Tokens local app (3-layer primitive->semantic->component gallery).\n\nvitest include extended to packages/**; 44 tests pass, lint clean, host+remote\nbuilds green; verified end-to-end in dev (host-embedded + standalone MSW).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: mark remote-network as deployed (https://remote-network.vercel.app)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"226a82365220febe3a08156b4d404d89f3566c76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/trees/226a82365220febe3a08156b4d404d89f3566c76"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/commits/e1f8ef31cd1f4b31ba4fc88403247286ece97ec1","verification":{"payload":"tree 226a82365220febe3a08156b4d404d89f3566c76\nparent f85558babca3b1bdb2027ac5c5cf6908bbe4137f\nauthor KBH <74466125+KBH-js@users.noreply.github.com> 1783946168 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783946168 +0900\n\nfeat: network dashboard remote (TanStack Query + MSW) + design-token guardrail (#9)\n\n* feat: network dashboard remote (TanStack Query + MSW) + design-token guardrail\n\nTier 2 — turn toy remotes into resume-evidence domain apps, consuming the\nTier 1 contracts (prefsStore / i18n / Federation Inspector) unchanged.\n\n⑤ packages/remote-network — OpenStack Neutron dashboard remote (:5003):\n  - TanStack Query: per-resource loading/error states, master-detail caching,\n    a \"Simulate outage\" toggle (resetQueries + retry:0) for error→recovery.\n  - MSW mock REST over one seeded db.ts: standalone browser worker (real\n    /api/neutron/*) with an in-memory fallback for host-embedded mode\n    (cross-origin service worker is impossible there).\n  - Host→remote bridge (src/federation/hostBridge.ts): locale via\n    host:locale-changed + useHostLocale; theme rides the shell .dark ancestor\n    through remote-scoped CSS-variable tokens.\n\n⑧ Design-token guardrail:\n  - eslint-rules/no-raw-colors.js (local/no-raw-colors) blocks raw hex/rgb/hsl\n    in .ts/.tsx; Desktop wallpaper moved into @proto/shared/theme, SnapPreview\n    rgba -> ring token, toastStore console art excepted.\n  - Design Tokens local app (3-layer primitive->semantic->component gallery).\n\nvitest include extended to packages/**; 44 tests pass, lint clean, host+remote\nbuilds green; verified end-to-end in dev (host-embedded + standalone MSW).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthrop