 3 — narrate the resume''s claims on screen, consuming Tier 1''s\ni18n/theme/Inspector contracts.\n\n- About: engineer-tone rewrite with an actionable \"Claims -> Evidence\"\n  table (rows open the Inspector, toggle theme/locale, or deep-link\n  source), technical-decisions and deployment/source sections, an honesty\n  banner, live/partial/planned tags, and full ko/en localization.\n- First-run spotlight tour (FirstRunTour + tourStore): coach-marks that\n  anchor to real desktop icons and the tray; shown once (localStorage),\n  replayable from About and the context menu.\n- Theme consistency: About/Resume author dark: variants; WindowFrame\n  content background is theme-aware. Remote internals keep their own\n  theme (host-only dark scope).\n- OS details: desktop right-click context menu (portaled), global\n  keyboard shortcuts (Alt+A/I/T/L, Alt+/), and a Module Federation\n  status strip in the taskbar tray.\n\nAdds tourStore/resolveShortcut unit tests (41 tests total). tsc, eslint,\nand the production build all pass.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6320103100fff818595d5184c793635147a7edf6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/trees/6320103100fff818595d5184c793635147a7edf6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/commits/f85558babca3b1bdb2027ac5c5cf6908bbe4137f","verification":{"payload":"tree 6320103100fff818595d5184c793635147a7edf6\nparent 3a6815149fb54d062750d12f11602bc18e6a8415\nauthor KBH <74466125+KBH-js@users.noreply.github.com> 1783945464 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783945464 +0900\n\nfeat: About rewrite, first-run tour, app theming, desktop OS details (#10)\n\nTier 3 — narrate the resume''s claims on screen, consuming Tier 1''s\ni18n/theme/Inspector contracts.\n\n- About: engineer-tone rewrite with an actionable \"Claims -> Evidence\"\n  table (rows open the Inspector, toggle theme/locale, or deep-link\n  source), technical-decisions and deployment/source sections, a