e) and swaps in a fresh React.lazy wrapper via useState\n- Add Notes remote (packages/remote-notes, :5002) with localStorage persistence\n- Isolate remote global CSS to standalone mode; exposed modules import their own CSS so styles inject into the host correctly\n- Split entries with async boundaries (main.tsx -> bootstrap.tsx) for MF shared module negotiation\n- Remove window.HOST_REACT handshake and VITE_REMOTE_CALCULATOR_URL define; React Compiler kept on host via @rsbuild/plugin-babel\n- Update Vercel configs to pnpm build; rewrite README/REMOTES.md for the new dev workflow (dev-mode remotes, no build+preview)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"19f4cf4eea5c72721c15129334eb4b67f3f8fa76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/trees/19f4cf4eea5c72721c15129334eb4b67f3f8fa76"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KBH-js/proto/git/commits/5d5cbc2191744bd2aae24e3bff9ae590ed53e086","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74466125?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KBH-js","id":74466125,"login":"KBH-js","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NDY2MTI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KBH-js","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.c