-ai/dip-for-supply-chain/commit/30425dbb0c54873254716bddc59cf232162bb1ae","node_id":"C_kwDORAWc09oAKDMwNDI1ZGJiMGM1NDg3MzI1NDcxNmJkZGM1OWNmMjMyMTYyYmIxYWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kweaver-ai/dip-for-supply-chain/commit/6d0b175230aaf3ce227ba69d4e9344a6be231e67","sha":"6d0b175230aaf3ce227ba69d4e9344a6be231e67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kweaver-ai/dip-for-supply-chain/commits/6d0b175230aaf3ce227ba69d4e9344a6be231e67"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/kweaver-ai/dip-for-supply-chain/commit/938895aa29174548f26345150bf16de6d4d4967d","sha":"938895aa29174548f26345150bf16de6d4d4967d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kweaver-ai/dip-for-supply-chain/commits/938895aa29174548f26345150bf16de6d4d4967d"}],"sha":"30425dbb0c54873254716bddc59cf232162bb1ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kweaver-ai/dip-for-supply-chain/commits/30425dbb0c54873254716bddc59cf232162bb1ae"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kweaver-ai/dip-for-supply-chain/commits/14796468b5d3f2126180a6afe4c9fccc751778e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-23T12:15:05Z","email":"mengling118@gmail.com","name":"Vania"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-23T12:15:05Z","email":"mengling118@gmail.com","name":"Vania"},"message":"fix: 修复配置中心保存API ID后不生效的问题\n\n配置中心保存知识网络ID时只更新了configStorageService，\n未同步到运行时变量currentKnowledgeNetworkId，导致API调用\n仍使用旧的KN ID。添加syncRuntimeState方法在保存后同步运行时状态。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"25b78f8779c36220c6e9729677c8066e9026ce3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kweaver-ai/dip-for-supply-chain/git/trees/25b78f8779c36220c6e9729677c8066e9026ce3d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kweaver-ai/dip-for-supply-chain/git/commits/14796468b5d3f2126180a6afe4c9fccc751778e5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/kweaver-ai/dip-for-supply-chain/commit/14796468b5d3f2126180a6