a/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akiroussama","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/akiroussama/mfe_cours/commits/5b7323eaa252ab4165f52c66a951e6b4b4d7c575/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-24T20:10:33Z","email":"akir.oussama@gmail.com","name":"Akir Oussama"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-24T20:10:33Z","email":"akir.oussama@gmail.com","name":"Akir Oussama"},"message":"docs: Mise à jour planning détaillé 08:30-17:00\n\n- Horaires: 08:30-17:00 (au lieu de 08:30-17:30)\n- 4 pauses de 15 min par jour (2 matin + 2 après-midi)\n- 1h déjeuner (12:30-13:30)\n- TP1 étendu à 90 min (frustration maximale)\n- Ratio 30% théorie / 70% pratique\n- Scripts détaillés pour chaque moment WOW\n- Checkpoints et timings précis\n- FAQ et troubleshooting\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b17b64bde3e71e86360ebce4e728d0f2e25ce630","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/akiroussama/mfe_cours/git/trees/b17b64bde3e71e86360ebce4e728d0f2e25ce630"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/akiroussama/mfe_cours/git/commits/5b7323eaa252ab4165f52c66a951e6b4b4d7c575","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29899520?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akiroussama/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akiroussama/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akiroussama/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akiroussama/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/akiroussama","id":29899520,"login":"akiroussama","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5ODk5NTIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akiroussama/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akiroussama/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akiroussama/repos","