hor":{"date":"2026-01-24T17:39:57Z","email":"akir.oussama@gmail.com","name":"Akir Oussama"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-24T17:39:57Z","email":"akir.oussama@gmail.com","name":"Akir Oussama"},"message":"feat: Complete Micro-Frontends course (16h - 2 days)\n\nCourse materials for university-level micro-frontends training:\n\n## Slides (173 slides total)\n- JOUR1_MATIN: La Valise, TP1 Monolithe, Wall of Pain, Histoire MFE\n- JOUR1_APRES_MIDI: 5 Chunks, Kahoot, TP2 Resurrection\n- JOUR2_MATIN: Master Class Arsenal, TP3 Babel Part 1\n- JOUR2_APRES_MIDI: Tribunal, Hackathon, Pitchs, Certificates\n\n## Quiz (20 questions)\n- QUIZ_COMPLET.md: Questions with answers and explanations\n- QUIZ_ETUDIANT.md: Student version without answers\n- GOOGLE_FORMS_IMPORT.md: Import guide + Apps Script\n\n## TPs (3 complete labs)\n- TP1 \"Monolithe de l''Enfer\": Intentionally horrible 823-line code\n- TP2 \"La Resurrection\": First micro-frontend with Module Federation\n- TP3 \"Tour de Babel\": Multi-framework architecture (44 files)\n\n## Assets & Guides\n- GLOSSAIRE_VISUEL.md: A2 poster with definitions\n- CERTIFICAT_TEMPLATE.md: Print + digital templates\n- KAHOOT_QUESTIONS.md: 10 interactive questions\n- GUIDE_FORMATEUR.md: Timing, WOW scripts, FAQ\n- DEBAT_FONDATEUR.md: 7 pedagogical principles\n\n20 competencies (C1-C20) | 6 bonus challenges | 4 WOW moments\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"231cabf07e1861eba0c4d90d088a0dd8e4df56ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/akiroussama/mfe_cours/git/trees/231cabf07e1861eba0c4d90d088a0dd8e4df56ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/akiroussama/mfe_cours/git/commits/c9517bbdd8fc29b18063855acbd3e342d10ecbe5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29899520?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akiroussama/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"ht